504
00:23:55,535 --> 00:23:56,770
- WAKKA-CHUKKA...
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

505
00:23:56,803 --> 00:23:58,538
WAKKA-CHUKKA-BOOM.
CHUKKA-WAKKA-CHUKKA BOOM.

506
00:23:58,572 --> 00:24:01,307
