579
00:26:42,768 --> 00:26:44,870
IT'S A MIDDLETON GROUP
OF TUBE-AMP LOVERS.

580
00:26:48,908 --> 00:26:51,477
KICK, PUNCH,
IT'S ALL IN THE MIND.

581
00:26:52,812 --> 00:26:55,248
HE'S ENJOYING THE BOLD,
ADVENTUROUS LIFE

582
00:26:55,282 --> 00:26:57,817
OF A TV REPAIRMAN.

583
00:27:00,053 --> 00:27:01,955
YOU BASTARD LOU REED.

584
00:27:01,988 --> 00:27:03,590
LET'S GO.

585
00:27:03,623 --> 00:27:05,658
STAY. I'LL PUT COFFEE ON.

586
00:27:05,692 --> 00:27:11,430
