661
00:30:58,858 --> 00:31:00,593
[GROANING]

662
00:31:00,627 --> 00:31:04,330
I CAN'T BELIEVE I DIRECTED
NORTH.

663
00:31:04,363 --> 00:31:09,102
CAN'T BELIEVE I GOT SENT
TO THE PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE AGAIN.

664
00:31:09,135 --> 00:31:10,403
WELL, DOC?

665
00:31:10,437 --> 00:31:12,338
WE'RE SAVING HIM,
