MAKING OUT WITH.

670
00:31:20,947 --> 00:31:22,782
- THE SEDATIVE.
- YES.

671
00:31:24,983 --> 00:31:27,053
HERE YOU GO.
THIS'LL MAKE YOUR COAT SHINY.

672
00:31:30,022 --> 00:31:31,657
[DOCTOR]
THAT SHOULD DO IT.
STAY WITH HIM.

673
00:31:31,690 --> 00:31:33,358
YES, DOCTOR.

674
00:31:33,392 --> 00:31:34,993
MAY I COME IN, PLEASE?

675
00:31:38,263 --> 00:31:39,665
