684
00:32:01,553 --> 00:32:04,357
WHATEVER IT IS, I WOULDN'T WANT
TO RUB IT THE WRONG WAY.

685
00:32:04,390 --> 00:32:06,425
WELL, I WOULD.

686
00:32:06,458 --> 00:32:08,995
- I'M NOT AN EXPERT...
- BUT THIS IS POINTY.

687
00:32:09,028 --> 00:32:12,098
...BUT THESE DON'T LOOK LIKE
THE TEETH MARKS
OF A SHARK TO ME.

688
00:32:12,132 --> 00:32:15,435
WHAT ELSE YOU THINK
IT MIGHT BE THEN?

689
00:32:15,468 --> 00:32:17,737
I'LL ANSWER THAT AS SOON AS WE
CUT BACK TO OUR SCENE.

690
00:32:17,770 --> 00:32:19,172
IT SHOULDN'T BE LONG.

691
00:32:19,205 --> 00:32:20,005
TRY IT NOW.

692
00:32:21,140 --> 00:32:23,308
I GET NOTHING.
NOTHING.

693
00:32:23,342 --> 00:32:25,043
NO RESPECT.

694
00:32:25,077 --> 00:32:27,247
WHAT DO YOU MEAN NOTHING?
DID YOU PUT THE FUSE IN?

695
00:32:29,248 --> 00:32:31,217
OF COURSE I INSERTED
THE DAMN FUSE.

696
00:32:31,283 --> 00:32:32,552
WHAT DO YOU TAKE ME FOR?

697
00:32:32,585 --> 00:32:34,220
NO COMMENT.

698
00:32:34,253 --> 00:32:36,722
OH, HE THREW
A LITTLE EURO-TANTRUM.

699
00:32:36,755 --> 00:32:38,658
THEY'VE BEEN GOING ON
LIKE THAT ALL MORNING.

700
00:32:38,692 --> 00:32:40,793
GENIUSES SHOULD NEVER
WORK TOGETHER.

701
00:32:40,827 --> 00:32:44,230
BUT THESE TWO GUYS'LL BE FINE.

702
00:32:44,263 --> 00:32:47,067
SANDRA. SANDRA.

703
00:32:47,100 --> 00:32:49,135
YES, MASTER?

704
00:32:49,168 --> 00:32:51,403
DON'T BE A WISE...
AND GO SEE WHAT'S WRONG
WITH THE MONITOR.

705
00:32:51,437 --> 00:32:54,740
YEAH.

706
00:32:54,773 --> 00:32:56,708
I WANT TO COME UP HERE
AND POUT A LITTLE BIT.

707
00:32:56,742 --> 00:32:59,345
IS THAT OKAY
IF I POUT A LITTLE?

708
00:32:59,378 --> 00:33:01,447
THINK IT'LL WORK?

709
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:03,415
WHAT, ARE YOU KIDDING?

710
00:33:03,448 --> 00:33:05,117
I LIKE THE COLOR OF YOUR EYES.

711
00:33:05,150 --> 00:33:06,552
THE REST OF YOU IS HIDEOUS.

712
00:33:06,585 --> 00:33:09,488
BYE.

713
00:33:12,692 --> 00:33:15,795
OKAY, GENIUS, WE'RE GETTING
A SIGNAL HERE.

714
00:33:15,828 --> 00:33:17,797
FINALLY. I'M GOING BELOW.
STAY TUNED.

715
00:33:17,830 --> 00:33:19,232
ALL RIGHT.

716
00:33:19,265 --> 00:33:20,867
[FOREIGN ACCENT]
BOY, AM I FROM FLORIDA.

717
00:33:24,503 --> 00:33:28,140
ISN'T THAT ONE GUY'S
EYE COLOR GROSS?

718
00:33:28,173 --> 00:33:29,508
WHEN WILL HE BE READY?

719
00:33:29,542 --> 00:33:33,512
JUST A COUPLE MORE HOURS.

720
00:33:33,545 --> 00:33:35,748
I'M GOING BACK TO ITALY.
BYE.

721
00:33:40,787 --> 00:33:42,488
KISS MY INK SAC.

722
00:33:45,758 --> 00:33:47,927
♪♪ [HUMS "SAILOR'S HORNPIPE"]

723
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:49,228
CRAP.

724
00:33:50,295 --> 00:33:52,732
I'M SORRY ABOUT YOUR VACATION.

725
00:33:52,765 --> 00:33:54,333
OH, REALLY?

726
00:33:54,367 --> 00:33:59,238
OH, NO, HE SUSPECTS MY
INSINCERITY ABOUT HIS VACATION.

727
00:33:59,272 --> 00:34:02,308
SO FAR I LIKE THESE SCENES
THE BEST.

728
00:34:05,343 --> 00:34:07,913
I WAS GOING TO SAY HOW SORRY
I WAS ABOUT YOUR CAT DYING,

729
00:34:07,947 --> 00:34:09,515
BUT FORGET IT.

730
00:34:09,548 --> 00:34:11,683
[BEEPING]

731
00:34:11,717 --> 00:34:14,553
OH, I FORGOT TO LICK
THE BEER OFF THE CAN.

732
00:34:14,587 --> 00:34:16,422
[ELECTRONIC SOUND]

733
00:34:16,455 --> 00:34:17,823
WHAT'S THAT?

734
00:34:17,857 --> 00:34:20,358
- KRAFTWERK.
- NOT SURE.

735
00:34:20,392 --> 00:34:22,762
HANG ON A SECOND.

736
00:34:22,795 --> 00:34:25,363
- WAIT.
- HOLD ON. WAIT. PAUSE.

737
00:34:25,397 --> 00:34:26,765
OKAY, WE GOT IT.

738
00:34:26,798 --> 00:34:28,333
A SHARK?

739
00:34:28,367 --> 00:34:29,702
YOU THINK IT'S HIM?

740
00:34:29,735 --> 00:34:31,337
I DON'T KNOW.
MIGHT BE.

741
00:34:31,370 --> 00:34:33,005
IT'S MOVING FAST,

742
00:34:33,038 --> 00:34:34,373
ALMOST 30 KNOTS.

743
00:34:35,842 --> 00:34:38,443
JUDGING FROM THE SOUND
OF ITS ECHO,

744
00:34:38,477 --> 00:34:41,447
DISPLACES A TREMENDOUS
AMOUNT OF WATER FOR A FISH.

745
00:34:41,513 --> 00:34:42,815
DO YOU READ ANYTHING ELSE?

746
00:34:45,350 --> 00:34:48,453
I DON'T KNOW.
MUST'VE DIVED TOO DEEP.

747
00:34:48,487 --> 00:34:50,557
YEAH, TO SAY THE LEAST.

748
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:53,025
MAYBE IT WASN'T HIM.

749
00:34:53,058 --> 00:34:55,260
HEY, BOB, SAVE US A BEER, TOO.
HUH?

750
00:34:55,293 --> 00:34:56,762
I WAS FRAMED, I TELL YA.

751
00:34:56,795 --> 00:34:58,697
YOU WANT ANOTHER?
THEN FIND THAT FISH.

752
00:34:58,730 --> 00:35:00,165
THAT'S EURO-FUNNY.

753
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:08,007
NOW, HOW DO THESE FIT?

754
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,475
YOU DID A GOOD JOB.

755
00:35:09,508 --> 00:35:11,043
BUY YOURSELF SOMETHING UGLY.

756
00:35:11,077 --> 00:35:12,077
NEED ANYTHING ELSE?

757
00:35:12,110 --> 00:35:13,412
JUST KEEP AN EYE ON HIM.

758
00:35:13,445 --> 00:35:16,315
I'LL LET YOU KNOW
WHEN WE NEED SOMETHING ELSE.

759
00:35:25,057 --> 00:35:27,025
MAN, JET SKIS
ARE GETTING HUGE.

760
00:35:29,128 --> 00:35:30,930
I WAS ONLY 19 WHEN I MET BOB.

761
00:35:30,963 --> 00:35:32,265
THAT'S WHEN I WAS SKINNY.

762
00:35:32,298 --> 00:35:34,133
HE WAS WITH THE ENGLISH
OCEANIC INSTITUTE

763
00:35:34,167 --> 00:35:36,302
BEFORE COMING TO FLORIDA.

764
00:35:36,335 --> 00:35:38,103
I LIKED WORKING
WITH HIM IMMEDIATELY.

765
00:35:38,137 --> 00:35:40,272
CELLO, 12 FATHOMS.

766
00:35:40,305 --> 00:35:42,642
OKAY, IT'S HIM!

767
00:35:42,675 --> 00:35:45,978
PETER!

768
00:35:45,978 --> 00:35:47,213
OH, INCOMING.

769
00:35:50,617 --> 00:35:53,185
[CHUCKLES]
I HUNG ONE OUT FOR FUN.

770
00:35:55,420 --> 00:35:58,123
I THINK IT'S THAT THING
THAT COMES OUT OF
THE WIZARD OF ID'S CAULDRON.

771
00:35:58,157 --> 00:36:00,292
[RUMBLING]

772
00:36:02,093 --> 00:36:04,130
IT'S HIS SOUND.
IT'S HIM.

773
00:36:07,267 --> 00:36:09,702
WHAT DO I THINK?

774
00:36:09,735 --> 00:36:11,470
COME ON, BABY.

775
00:36:11,503 --> 00:36:14,740
COME ON UP.

776
00:36:14,773 --> 00:36:17,175
♪ SLOW RIDE ♪

777
00:36:17,210 --> 00:36:19,012
WE'VE GOT THREE HOURS
BEFORE IT GETS HERE.

778
00:36:19,045 --> 00:36:20,078
WANNA PLAY RISK?

779
00:36:20,112 --> 00:36:22,648
LET'S SEE IF HE RECORDS.

780
00:36:22,682 --> 00:36:26,018
[GURGLING]
♪ I DREAM OF JEANIE ♪

781
00:36:27,453 --> 00:36:32,123
YOU BLOODY, ROTTEN, FILTHY SOD,
LET ME HEAR YOU.

782
00:36:32,157 --> 00:36:35,360
WELL, GLUB, I GUESS.

783
00:36:35,393 --> 00:36:38,097
IT'S BEARING 1.2.0.

784
00:36:38,130 --> 00:36:40,298
COMING UP AT US TWO POINTS
OFF THE STARBOARD BOW.

785
00:36:40,332 --> 00:36:41,800
[WOMAN]
HOW BIG IS IT?

786
00:36:41,833 --> 00:36:43,435
I DON'T KNOW.

787
00:36:43,468 --> 00:36:46,272
DO YOU THINK IT WILL RECORD?

788
00:36:46,305 --> 00:36:47,473
LET'S HOPE SO.

789
00:36:47,507 --> 00:36:50,142
ALTHOUGH WE ARE HAVING
TENTACLE DIFFICULTIES.

790
00:36:50,208 --> 00:36:52,143
THIS SHOULD FILTER OUT
ALL THE INTERFERENCE

791
00:36:52,177 --> 00:36:54,080
ONCE I LOCK ON TO
HIS FREQUENCY.

792
00:36:54,113 --> 00:36:55,347
IT'LL BE COMPUTERIZED.

793
00:36:55,380 --> 00:36:57,483
- THEN WE'LL BE ABLE TO--
- [HOWLING]

794
00:36:57,517 --> 00:36:59,085
GOD.

795
00:36:59,118 --> 00:37:00,485
WHAT'S THE MATTER?

796
00:37:00,518 --> 00:37:01,787
HARD TO TELL.

797
00:37:01,820 --> 00:37:03,022
I THINK IT'S FREQUENCY
IS SO HIGH,

798
00:37:03,055 --> 00:37:05,057
IT'S SCREWED UP THE RECORDER,

799
00:37:05,090 --> 00:37:06,392
BUT WHATEVER IT IS,
IT ISN'T KIDDING,

800
00:37:06,425 --> 00:37:07,527
AND IT'S COMING RIGHT AT US.

801
00:37:07,560 --> 00:37:09,595
IT'S HEADED THIS WAY.

802
00:37:09,628 --> 00:37:11,063
DAVEY JOHNSTONE!

803
00:37:11,097 --> 00:37:12,565
DUH.

804
00:37:12,598 --> 00:37:15,233
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
DUH?

805
00:37:15,267 --> 00:37:17,202
HOW MANY FEET AWAY, PETER?

806
00:37:17,235 --> 00:37:18,537
A HUNDRED APPROXIMATELY.

807
00:37:18,570 --> 00:37:20,405
- 75.
- DUH.

808
00:37:20,438 --> 00:37:21,507
50.

809
00:37:21,540 --> 00:37:23,142
SEE ANYTHING, STELLA?

810
00:37:23,175 --> 00:37:25,310
NO, I GET NOTHING
ON THE SURFACE.

811
00:37:25,343 --> 00:37:27,747
IT'S NOT POSSIBLE.
KEEP LOOKING.

812
00:37:27,780 --> 00:37:31,517
25 FEET,
AND IT'S PICKING UP SPEED.

813
00:37:31,550 --> 00:37:34,820
MM, TEN FEET, EIGHT FEET.

814
00:37:34,853 --> 00:37:37,390
IT'S NOT A SHARK.

815
00:37:37,423 --> 00:37:40,158
HOW WOULD YOU KNOW?
AN ELECTRICIAN?

816
00:37:40,192 --> 00:37:41,727
I'LL BET IT'S NOT A SHARK.

817
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:43,462
YOU ARE SUCH AN ELECTRICIAN.

818
00:37:43,495 --> 00:37:45,463
[DOLPHINS SQUEAKING]

819
00:37:45,497 --> 00:37:48,233
DOLPHINS WIN THE SUPER BOWL!
YAY!

820
00:37:50,502 --> 00:37:52,805
TWENTY FEET NOW.

821
00:37:52,838 --> 00:37:54,873
FIFTEEN, HE'S...

822
00:37:54,873 --> 00:37:57,275
IT'S TURNING.

823
00:37:57,310 --> 00:37:59,445
DAMMIT, IT'S GOING AWAY.

824
00:37:59,478 --> 00:38:00,545
TURN.

825
00:38:02,315 --> 00:38:03,648
IT'S DIVING.

826
00:38:03,682 --> 00:38:05,217
IT'S GOING DOWN.

827
00:38:05,250 --> 00:38:06,852
CAN YOU STILL FOLLOW HIM?

828
00:38:06,885 --> 00:38:09,355
I DIDN'T KNOW HE WAS
AN ELECTRICIAN.

829
00:38:10,757 --> 00:38:14,293
NOW I'M LOSING HIM.

830
00:38:14,327 --> 00:38:15,227
HE'S GONE.

831
00:38:15,260 --> 00:38:17,697
THANKS A LOT, ELECTRICIAN.

832
00:38:19,598 --> 00:38:22,233
[AUDIO REWINDING]

833
00:38:22,267 --> 00:38:24,270
GOOD MORNING, MR. EUROPEAN.

834
00:38:24,303 --> 00:38:25,805
[RUMBLING]

835
00:38:25,838 --> 00:38:27,238
I KNOW THAT SOUND.

836
00:38:27,272 --> 00:38:29,808
IT'S AN OIL DRUM BEING DRAGGED
ACROSS A GARAGE FLOOR.

837
00:38:32,512 --> 00:38:36,715
THE SOUND
OF WILLIAM CONRAD'S HEART.

838
00:38:36,748 --> 00:38:38,883
WHAT DO YOU GUYS WANT?
I GOT BEER, BEER,

839
00:38:38,950 --> 00:38:40,452
AND, OH, HEY, LOOK.
THERE'S A BEER.

840
00:38:43,355 --> 00:38:44,957
SORRY ABOUT THAT ELECTRICIAN
CRACK EARLIER.

841
00:38:44,990 --> 00:38:47,627
MY FATHER'S VILLAGE
WAS ATTACKED BY ELECTRICIANS.

842
00:38:47,660 --> 00:38:49,328
I NEVER HEARD ANYTHING
QUITE LIKE THAT.

843
00:38:49,362 --> 00:38:50,528
RIGHT.

844
00:38:50,562 --> 00:38:52,263
THEY MIGHT BE THE SOUND
OF A MARINE SPECIMEN

845
00:38:52,297 --> 00:38:53,632
WE DON'T KNOW ABOUT.

846
00:38:53,665 --> 00:38:56,168
AND IT SURE SCARES THE HELL
OUT OF ALL THE OTHER FISH.

847
00:38:56,202 --> 00:38:57,503
[IMITATES BURP]

848
00:38:57,537 --> 00:39:00,272
IS THAT RECORDING GOOD ENOUGH
TO IDENTIFY THE THING?

849
00:39:00,338 --> 00:39:04,543
MAYBE. BUT WE DON'T HAVE
THE PROPER EQUIPMENT.

850
00:39:04,577 --> 00:39:05,577
- MM.
- RIGHT, BOB?

851
00:39:05,610 --> 00:39:07,880
YEAH, ONLY THAT PIG WEST
HAS IT AT W.O.I.

852
00:39:07,913 --> 00:39:09,048
PIG.

853
00:39:09,082 --> 00:39:10,850
THE ONLY THING HE LACKS
IS A LITTLE HUMANITY.

854
00:39:10,883 --> 00:39:12,918
SO I THINK OUR VIKING'S
ALL WIRED UP.

855
00:39:16,522 --> 00:39:19,358
"OH, MY LEGS GOT BIT OFF."
BE QUIET, YOU BABY.

856
00:39:19,392 --> 00:39:20,392
[GROANS SOFTLY]

857
00:39:20,425 --> 00:39:21,960
WILL HE MAKE IT, DOC?

858
00:39:22,027 --> 00:39:24,497
WE CAN ONLY BEGIN TO HOPE.

859
00:39:24,530 --> 00:39:26,432
ONCE HE GETS OUT OF THIS COMA.

860
00:39:26,465 --> 00:39:28,933
I CAN ONLY TELL YOU WE'RE
DOING EVERYTHING POSSIBLE.

861
00:39:28,967 --> 00:39:31,370
SORRY WE HAD TO PUT HIM
IN THIS CLOSET.

862
00:39:31,403 --> 00:39:32,938
OOH, CHARLIE HORSE!

863
00:39:32,972 --> 00:39:35,040
[GROANS]

864
00:39:35,073 --> 00:39:37,008
HOW DOES KISSING HIM HELP?

865
00:39:40,780 --> 00:39:46,252
HANG ON. I GOT TO STAMP
A NEW PRICE ON IT.

866
00:39:46,285 --> 00:39:47,453
INTEL STEADY AT 35.

867
00:39:47,487 --> 00:39:52,390
NURSE, FOUR MILLIGRAMS
OF ADRENALINE. QUICK.

868
00:39:52,425 --> 00:39:53,458
[SUSTAINED TONE]

869
00:39:53,492 --> 00:39:54,493
COME ON.

870
00:39:54,527 --> 00:39:58,797
HIS BROADCAST DAY IS OVER.

871
00:39:58,830 --> 00:39:59,898
DOCTOR, THE ADRENALINE.

872
00:39:59,932 --> 00:40:04,903
I'LL SQUIRT IT
IN THE GENERAL AREA.

873
00:40:04,903 --> 00:40:05,938
[LAUGHS]

874
00:40:05,972 --> 00:40:11,543
WELL, AT LEAST
HE SEEMS STABILIZED NOW.

875
00:40:11,577 --> 00:40:15,047
OH, I SEE NOW.
I HAD IT SET ON "KILL PATIENT."

876
00:40:15,080 --> 00:40:16,982
I'M SORRY, SHERIFF.

877
00:40:17,015 --> 00:40:19,418
YOU CAN'T BORROW
MY SMOKED GLASSES.

878
00:40:19,452 --> 00:40:22,855
HE'S DEAD.
HIS HEART JUST GAVE OUT.

879
00:40:22,888 --> 00:40:24,088
WELL, I GAVE IT OUT,
ACTUALLY.

880
00:40:24,123 --> 00:40:25,457
YEAH, IT WAS FEAR.

881
00:40:25,490 --> 00:40:27,125
FEAR STOPPED HIS HEART.

882
00:40:27,158 --> 00:40:32,565
WELL, YOU'D BE SCARED TOO
IF I WAS YOUR DOCTOR.

883
00:40:32,598 --> 00:40:35,902
BEHIND THE SCENES
AT MTV UNPLUGGED.

884
00:40:35,935 --> 00:40:36,935
AH.

885
00:40:36,968 --> 00:40:38,537
NEED A COPY MADE, AUDIENCE?

886
00:40:42,942 --> 00:40:45,978
SCENE'S STARTING.
PASS IT ON.

887
00:40:46,012 --> 00:40:47,412
SCENE'S STARTING.
PASS IT ON.

888
00:40:47,445 --> 00:40:49,648
WE FEEL SURE THAT WHATEVER
IS MAKING THAT NOISE

889
00:40:49,682 --> 00:40:51,483
HASN'T BEEN CLASSIFIED
AS YET.

890
00:40:51,517 --> 00:40:53,585
A FASCINATING THOUGHT.

891
00:40:53,618 --> 00:40:55,855
I HOPE WE CAN COUNT
ON YOUR COLLABORATION.

892
00:40:55,888 --> 00:40:59,057
YOUR EQUIPMENT IS MUCH MORE
UP TO DATE THAN OURS.

893
00:40:59,090 --> 00:41:03,995
♪♪ [HUMMING JAWS THEME]

894
00:41:04,028 --> 00:41:05,730
THERE SHOULDN'T
BE ANY PROBLEM.

895
00:41:05,763 --> 00:41:07,465
OF COURSE NOT.

896
00:41:07,500 --> 00:41:10,168
WE'RE DELIGHTED
TO ASSIST ANYONE

897
00:41:10,202 --> 00:41:12,638
WHO TRULY LOVES THE SEA
AND ITS CREATURES

898
00:41:12,672 --> 00:41:14,473
- THE WAY WE DO.
- AREN'T WE?

899
00:41:14,507 --> 00:41:16,908
BESIDES,
THE POSSIBLE DISCOVERY

900
00:41:16,942 --> 00:41:19,978
OF A HITHERTO UNKNOWN
MARINE SPECIES

901
00:41:20,012 --> 00:41:23,315
WOULD BE OF A HISTORICAL
IMPORTANCE TO ALL OF US.

902
00:41:23,348 --> 00:41:24,750
COOKIES ARE READY.

903
00:41:24,783 --> 00:41:28,953
YOU'LL HAVE TO LEAVE US
THE RECORDED SOUNDS, I'M AFRAID.

904
00:41:28,987 --> 00:41:30,555
HOW MUCH TIME
DO YOU THINK YOU'LL NEED?

905
00:41:30,622 --> 00:41:33,125
HOWEVER LONG IT TAKES.

906
00:41:33,158 --> 00:41:34,158
HEY, DID YOU SEE THAT?

907
00:41:34,193 --> 00:41:35,493
THAT GUY
JUST BENCH-PRESSED ME.

908
00:41:35,527 --> 00:41:36,528
[LAUGHS]

909
00:41:36,562 --> 00:41:38,997
♪♪ [DRAMATIC]

910
00:41:39,030 --> 00:41:41,000
BEERY GUY'S THEME.

911
00:41:46,705 --> 00:41:47,973
OKAY, WHAT IS IT NOW?

912
00:41:48,007 --> 00:41:52,210
10, 10, 10, 10, 3-2-1, 10?

913
00:41:52,210 --> 00:41:54,580
HELLO, PALEONTOLOGICAL
INSTITUTE?

914
00:41:54,613 --> 00:41:55,780
"PALLY"?

915
00:41:55,813 --> 00:41:58,017
I'D LIKE TO SPEAK
TO MRS. BATES, PLEASE.

916
00:41:58,050 --> 00:41:59,818
JANET BATES.

917
00:41:59,852 --> 00:42:01,587
MEANWHILE,
IN THE WORLD TODAY...

918
00:42:01,620 --> 00:42:03,655
[PHONE BEEPING]

919
00:42:03,688 --> 00:42:06,158
JOAN BAEZ FAN.
HELLO.

920
00:42:06,192 --> 00:42:07,893
- HELLO?
- HELLO, SWEETHEART. I--

921
00:42:07,927 --> 00:42:09,262
- OH, BOB!
- LET ME FINISH.

922
00:42:09,295 --> 00:42:11,530
HOW NICE
TO HEAR YOUR VOICE AGAIN.

923
00:42:11,563 --> 00:42:12,998
ARE YOU STILL
ENTERTAINING DOLPHINS?

924
00:42:13,032 --> 00:42:14,900
I'M CALLING FOR SOMETHING
VERY IMPORTANT.

925
00:42:14,933 --> 00:42:16,568
CATCH THE FIRST PLANE
AND COME DOWN.

926
00:42:16,602 --> 00:42:18,603
EXPLAIN WHY.
WHAT'S UP?

927
00:42:18,637 --> 00:42:20,005
WELL, AS YET,
I'M NOT TOO SURE.

928
00:42:20,038 --> 00:42:22,642
BRING ALL YOUR NOTES
ON PROTO-SHARKS.

929
00:42:22,675 --> 00:42:24,042
YOU'RE KIDDING.

930
00:42:24,075 --> 00:42:27,713
I MAY BE ONTO SOMETHING
REALLY INCREDIBLE.

931
00:42:31,117 --> 00:42:33,652
[YAWNS]
I GUESS I'M TIRED.

932
00:42:35,420 --> 00:42:38,657
APPROXIMATELY 320 YEARS AGO,

933
00:42:38,690 --> 00:42:42,093
NEW FORMS OF FISH DEVELOPED.
FISH WITH TEETH.

934
00:42:42,127 --> 00:42:44,363
AND AMONG THEM WAS
THE "DILICTUS,"

935
00:42:44,397 --> 00:42:47,600
A DEADLY PREDATOR THAT MEASURED
OVER 20 FEET LONG.

936
00:42:47,633 --> 00:42:50,368
THE KRONOSAURUS
DESCENDED FROM THIS SPECIES

937
00:42:50,402 --> 00:42:52,672
AND THRIVED
IN THE JURASSIC PERIOD.

938
00:42:52,705 --> 00:42:54,573
SLIDE PLEASE.

939
00:42:54,607 --> 00:42:56,542
[IMITATES OPERATIC SINGING]

940
00:42:56,608 --> 00:42:58,143
...ANOTHER AWESOME PREDATOR.

941
00:42:58,177 --> 00:43:00,947
IT APPEARED AT THE BEGINNING
OF THE CETACEOUS PERIOD,

942
00:43:00,980 --> 00:43:03,515
ABOUT 120 MILLION YEARS AGO.

943
00:43:03,548 --> 00:43:05,283
[ALL]
BORING.

944
00:43:05,317 --> 00:43:07,518
WE CONSIDER THE TRUE
ANCESTOR OF THE SHARK

945
00:43:07,552 --> 00:43:11,190
- AS WE KNOW IT TODAY...
- [IMITATES OPERATIC SINGING]

946
00:43:11,223 --> 00:43:14,960
...AND IT APPEARED AT THE END
OF THE CETACEOUS ERA,

947
00:43:14,993 --> 00:43:17,328
60 MILLION YEARS AGO.

948
00:43:17,362 --> 00:43:19,365
THANKS, KOTTER'S WIFE.

949
00:43:19,398 --> 00:43:22,233
NOW THEN. I STUDIED
THIS CAST VERY CAREFULLY,

950
00:43:22,267 --> 00:43:26,005
AND I FED THE RESULTS OF MY
EXAMINATION INTO THE COMPUTER.

951
00:43:26,038 --> 00:43:27,038
HMM?

952
00:43:27,072 --> 00:43:28,707
AND SHE JUST GOT HERE
LAST NIGHT?

953
00:43:28,740 --> 00:43:31,143
DUH, WHA--WHA?

954
00:43:31,177 --> 00:43:33,778
NOW, THE COMPARATIVE RESULTS
ARE NOT ABSOLUTELY DEFINITIVE,

955
00:43:33,812 --> 00:43:36,548
BUT I THINK
I CAN SAFELY SAY...

956
00:43:36,582 --> 00:43:39,685
- WAH, WAH, WAH, WAH, WAH.
- ...THAT THE CREATURE FOUND
IN YOUR PART OF THE OCEAN

957
00:43:39,685 --> 00:43:42,420
IS A LIVING FOSSIL.

958
00:43:48,760 --> 00:43:51,797
AND THAT WAS THE DAY
I MET DICK MEEKER.

959
00:43:51,830 --> 00:43:53,732
AW, THAT'S NICE.

960
00:43:53,765 --> 00:43:56,768
YOU GUYS, WE GOT A CALL
FROM THIS WEIRD LADY.

961
00:43:56,802 --> 00:43:58,803
REAL MEAN, BUT KINDA STUPID.

962
00:43:58,837 --> 00:44:00,372
A LOT OF DISHWATER BLONDE HAIR.

963
00:44:00,405 --> 00:44:01,573
OH, MRS. FORRESTER.

964
00:44:01,573 --> 00:44:02,875
- THAT'S WHO IT WAS.
- YEAH.

965
00:44:02,908 --> 00:44:05,377
ANYWAY, SHE'S GONNA
BE SENDING AN ELECTRICIAN

966
00:44:05,410 --> 00:44:06,912
UP HERE TO DO SOME STUFF.

967
00:44:06,945 --> 00:44:07,947
- THANKS, GYPS.
- OKAY.

968
00:44:07,980 --> 00:44:10,548
HEY, HEY, AN ELECTRICIAN.

969
00:44:10,582 --> 00:44:11,817
SO?

970
00:44:11,850 --> 00:44:14,085
OH, COME ON. EVERYBODY
KNOWS ABOUT ELECTRICIANS.

971
00:44:14,118 --> 00:44:17,188
UM, MIKE, JUST BECAUSE
THE MOVIE VAGUELY IMPLIES

972
00:44:17,222 --> 00:44:19,425
THAT SOME ELECTRICIANS
MAY BE LACKING IN SOMETHING--

973
00:44:19,458 --> 00:44:20,858
- ARE YOU MIKE?
- YEAH.

974
00:44:20,892 --> 00:44:23,495
I'M GONNA BE INSTALLING
SOME GROUNDED OUTLETS

975
00:44:23,528 --> 00:44:24,830
ALONG THE BASEBOARD
BACK THERE.

976
00:44:24,863 --> 00:44:26,098
OH, OKAY. GREAT.
WE NEED THOSE.

977
00:44:26,132 --> 00:44:27,265
SO THANKS.
I APPRECIATE IT.

978
00:44:27,298 --> 00:44:28,300
OH, MIKE.

979
00:44:28,333 --> 00:44:29,502
YEAH. UH, SO ANYWAY,

980
00:44:29,535 --> 00:44:31,337
YOU SHOULD BE ABLE TO RUN
YOUR DEHUMIDIFIER

981
00:44:31,370 --> 00:44:32,437
OFF THOSE, UH...

982
00:44:32,470 --> 00:44:33,905
YOU KNOW WHAT?
I JUST WANNA WARN YOU.

983
00:44:33,938 --> 00:44:35,707
YOU GOT A LITTLE SPOT
RIGHT THERE ON YOUR SHIRT.

984
00:44:35,740 --> 00:44:36,808
YEAH. OKAY.

985
00:44:36,842 --> 00:44:38,777
- OH, MIKE.
- IT'S EMBARRASSING.

986
00:44:38,810 --> 00:44:40,478
OH, HEY,
LOOK AT THIS, YOU GUYS.

987
00:44:40,512 --> 00:44:42,013
YOU SEE, I KNOW HOW
TO USE THE PHONE,

988
00:44:42,047 --> 00:44:43,448
BECAUSE I'M AN ELECTRICIAN.

989
00:44:43,482 --> 00:44:46,585
[MUMBLES, LAUGHS]

990
00:44:46,618 --> 00:44:48,887
[LASER FIRES]

991
00:44:48,920 --> 00:44:50,122
HEY, MIKE.

992
00:44:50,155 --> 00:44:52,792
DOLPHIN WAR BIRD UNCLOAKING
OFF THE PORT BOW.

993
00:44:52,825 --> 00:44:53,792
OH!

994
00:44:53,825 --> 00:44:55,360
CAMBOT,
GIVE ME ROCKET NUMBER NINE.

995
00:44:59,197 --> 00:45:01,900
WHAT IN BLAZES IS GOING ON?

996
00:45:01,933 --> 00:45:03,435
I'LL TELL YOU,
AFTER THIS MOVIE CAME OUT,

997
00:45:03,468 --> 00:45:05,870
WE ELECTRICIANS STARTED
HAVING A LOT OF TROUBLE.

998
00:45:05,903 --> 00:45:07,205
OH!

999
00:45:07,238 --> 00:45:09,875
SO WE FORMED A MUTUAL
DEFENSE PACT WITH THE DOLPHINS.

1000
00:45:09,908 --> 00:45:11,377
ARE THEY GONNA KILL US?

1001
00:45:11,410 --> 00:45:13,578
UNLESS YOUR MOUTHY FRIEND
HERE APOLOGIZES,

1002
00:45:13,612 --> 00:45:14,613
YEAH, SURE.

1003
00:45:14,647 --> 00:45:15,847
MIKE.

1004
00:45:15,880 --> 00:45:16,882
WELL, I'M SORRY.

1005
00:45:16,915 --> 00:45:18,483
[LASER FIRES]

1006
00:45:18,517 --> 00:45:20,185
APOLOGIZE TO US NICELY.

1007
00:45:20,218 --> 00:45:22,220
OKAY, OKAY.
I'M VERY SORRY.

1008
00:45:22,253 --> 00:45:24,255
I APOLOGIZE
TO ALL ELECTRICIANS.

1009
00:45:24,288 --> 00:45:27,893
I REALIZE NOW THAT ELECTRICIANS
PROVIDE A VALUABLE SERVICE,

1010
00:45:27,927 --> 00:45:29,962
AND POSSESS A LEVEL
OF TECHNICAL KNOWLEDGE

1011
00:45:29,995 --> 00:45:32,063
FAR BEYOND ANYTHING
I COULD EVER GRASP.

1012
00:45:32,097 --> 00:45:33,465
GOD BLESS ELECTRICIANS.

1013
00:45:33,498 --> 00:45:35,100
GREAT. I'LL BE GETTING BACK
TO WORK THEN.

1014
00:45:35,133 --> 00:45:37,235
OKAY. I AM SORRY.

1015
00:45:37,268 --> 00:45:39,003
HEY, IDIOT.
WE GOT MOVIE SIGN.

1016
00:45:39,037 --> 00:45:40,938
WHICH WE COULD NEVER HAVE
WITHOUT ELECTRICIANS.

1017
00:45:40,972 --> 00:45:41,973
SHUT UP.

1018
00:45:42,007 --> 00:45:43,542
[ALARM BEEPING]

1019
00:45:53,952 --> 00:45:55,487
- DOORKNOB.
- JEEZ.

1020
00:45:55,520 --> 00:45:59,257
FEEL KINDA BAD ABOUT IT.

1021
00:45:59,290 --> 00:46:00,825
HEY.
WHAT'S A GUY GOT TO DO

1022
00:46:00,858 --> 00:46:02,962
TO GET AN OREO COOKIE
BLIZZARD AROUND HERE?

1023
00:46:06,632 --> 00:46:07,632
OOH.

1024
00:46:07,665 --> 00:46:09,902
- MILLER.
- WANT AN OLIVE?

1025
00:46:09,935 --> 00:46:11,637
NO, I ONLY WANT YOU
TO GET LOST.

1026
00:46:11,670 --> 00:46:13,005
WE MADE A DEAL.

1027
00:46:13,038 --> 00:46:14,405
I GAVE YOU THE KEY TO THE SHOP

1028
00:46:14,438 --> 00:46:16,508
ONLY SO YOU COULD TAKE
THE CONVERTER, AND THAT'S ALL.

1029
00:46:16,542 --> 00:46:18,310
ARE YOU MAD BECAUSE
WE ROUGHED UP YOUR BOYFRIEND?

1030
00:46:18,343 --> 00:46:19,512
IDIOT.

1031
00:46:19,545 --> 00:46:21,480
THERE WAS A TIME
WHEN YOU WERE A LOT SWEETER.

1032
00:46:21,513 --> 00:46:23,415
YEAH, AND I PREFER
NOT TO THINK ABOUT IT.

1033
00:46:23,448 --> 00:46:25,250
IT'S OVER. YOU GOT IT?
ALL OVER.

1034
00:46:25,283 --> 00:46:28,587
YOU'RE GONNA DO EXACTLY
WHAT I TELL YOU TO DO,

1035
00:46:28,620 --> 00:46:29,622
UNDERSTAND?

1036
00:46:29,655 --> 00:46:30,655
YOU ARE HURTING ME.

1037
00:46:30,688 --> 00:46:32,590
NO,
I'M REMINDING YOU

1038
00:46:32,657 --> 00:46:35,593
THAT YOU'LL BE RECEIVING
FURTHER INSTRUCTIONS.

1039
00:46:35,627 --> 00:46:37,162
TOWEL BOY'S A REAL JERK.

1040
00:46:37,195 --> 00:46:38,963
[IMITATING GIRL]
BOY, HE WAS SO MEAN TO ME.

1041
00:46:38,997 --> 00:46:40,298
I THINK
I'LL GO OVER THERE AND...

1042
00:46:40,332 --> 00:46:43,168
[MUMBLES]

1043
00:46:46,538 --> 00:46:50,042
[IMITATING DRAMATIC MUSIC]

1044
00:46:50,075 --> 00:46:52,243
I MUST CALL STEVE McGARRETT.

1045
00:46:55,747 --> 00:46:57,048
HELLO?

1046
00:46:57,082 --> 00:46:59,785
I WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK
TO SHERIFF GORDON.

1047
00:46:59,818 --> 00:47:01,018
I'LL WAIT.

1048
00:47:01,052 --> 00:47:02,020
NO, YOU WON'T.

1049
00:47:02,053 --> 00:47:03,355
MY MOM MIGHT CALL.
[CHUCKLES]

1050
00:47:08,560 --> 00:47:10,362
PERSONAL TRAINER
TO PAUL REUBENS.

1051
00:47:10,395 --> 00:47:13,432
[LAUGHS]

1052
00:47:13,465 --> 00:47:15,033
OH, YOU COULD HAVE
PUT GRANDMA'S ASHES

1053
00:47:15,033 --> 00:47:16,568
IN A MORE
DIGNIFIED CONTAINER.

1054
00:47:22,107 --> 00:47:24,075
FISHING FOR DEEP SEA CLOWNS.

1055
00:47:28,747 --> 00:47:31,015
THEY'RE DEPLOYING
SEA DREIDELS.

1056
00:47:34,218 --> 00:47:35,520
THERE.
I'M SICK OF THESE THINGS.

1057
00:47:35,553 --> 00:47:37,455
THEY'RE JUST CLUTTERING UP
THE DECK AND ALL.

1058
00:47:45,430 --> 00:47:47,832
NOW DOES A RABBIT
COME OUT OF THE THING...

1059
00:47:47,865 --> 00:47:51,537
DOES SOMETHING. AH, OKAY.
THERE. GOOD ENOUGH.

1060
00:47:51,570 --> 00:47:54,172
MOM WILL LOVE THIS BIRTHDAY GIFT
I MADE FOR HER.

1061
00:48:01,347 --> 00:48:03,348
AH, CAPTAIN PANTYHOSE.

1062
00:48:07,318 --> 00:48:09,187
WHAT'S THAT FOR?

1063
00:48:09,220 --> 00:48:10,755
WELL, UH, BASICALLY,

1064
00:48:10,788 --> 00:48:12,590
WE DROP THESE
IN VARIOUS PLACES

1065
00:48:12,623 --> 00:48:14,860
TO COVER THE AREA
OF SURVEILLANCE.

1066
00:48:14,893 --> 00:48:16,093
MM-HMM.

1067
00:48:16,127 --> 00:48:17,395
EACH ONE HAS
A SENSITIVE HYDROPHONE

1068
00:48:17,428 --> 00:48:19,430
AND THIS SATELLITE
TRANSMITTER.

1069
00:48:19,463 --> 00:48:22,133
AND THEY'RE CONNECTED
TO A RECEIVER IN THE COMPUTER.

1070
00:48:22,167 --> 00:48:23,235
OH.

1071
00:48:23,268 --> 00:48:24,502
THEN IF OUR FRIEND
COMES IN THE AREA,

1072
00:48:24,535 --> 00:48:25,537
WE'LL PICK HIM UP.

1073
00:48:25,570 --> 00:48:29,608
OH.

1074
00:48:29,642 --> 00:48:31,277
16TH IS A WATER HOLE

1075
00:48:31,310 --> 00:48:33,745
SURROUNDED BY WATER
ON ALL SIDES.

1076
00:48:33,778 --> 00:48:36,715
I'M GONNA PUT SOME
POTPOURRI IN THE CROW'S NEST.

1077
00:48:36,748 --> 00:48:39,283
YOU'RE SHOOTING IN 100 CCs?

1078
00:48:39,317 --> 00:48:40,318
MM-HMM.

1079
00:48:40,352 --> 00:48:41,353
YOU THINK THAT'S ENOUGH?

1080
00:48:41,387 --> 00:48:42,453
I HOPE SO.

1081
00:48:42,487 --> 00:48:44,355
THE DOSE WOULD PUT
A WHALE TO SLEEP.

1082
00:48:44,388 --> 00:48:48,560
HMM.

1083
00:48:48,593 --> 00:48:52,230
OH, THAT ALLEN FUNT
TURNS UP EVERYWHERE.

1084
00:48:52,263 --> 00:48:57,268
THEY'RE GONNA SEE A DOLPHIN
ROBBING A 7-ELEVEN.

1085
00:48:57,302 --> 00:48:58,903
- OH, GOOD.
- YOU MADE MUFFINS.

1086
00:48:58,937 --> 00:49:00,338
IT'S DIRECTIONAL.

1087
00:49:00,372 --> 00:49:02,207
BUT TO BE SURE
WE PICK 'EM UP,

1088
00:49:02,240 --> 00:49:04,042
I THINK IT'S BEST
IF WE HAVE THE CAMERA

1089
00:49:04,075 --> 00:49:05,277
MOUNTED AT THE BOW.

1090
00:49:05,310 --> 00:49:07,412
THEN THAT'S WHERE
WE'LL HAVE IT.

1091
00:49:07,445 --> 00:49:10,348
THE BEER'S OVER THERE
IN THAT BOX.

1092
00:49:12,583 --> 00:49:14,485
WOULDN'T IT BE GREAT
IF YOU WERE DEVIL FISHING

1093
00:49:14,518 --> 00:49:15,520
AND THEY HAD BEER?

1094
00:49:15,553 --> 00:49:18,390
REALLY WATERY
AMERICAN BEER.

1095
00:49:18,423 --> 00:49:20,325
UP THE SHARK'S ASS.

1096
00:49:20,358 --> 00:49:23,295
YOU KNOW, AFTER THIS BEER,
WE SHOULD HAVE A BEER SOMETIME.

1097
00:49:23,328 --> 00:49:24,328
MM.

1098
00:49:24,362 --> 00:49:26,230
I THOUGHT ONLY DOLPHINS
EMITTED SOUND.

1099
00:49:26,263 --> 00:49:27,832
WELL, DOLPHINS
HAVE A LANGUAGE,

1100
00:49:27,865 --> 00:49:28,867
BUT ALL FISH EMIT SOUNDS,

1101
00:49:28,900 --> 00:49:30,468
AND RATHER COMPLEX ONES.

1102
00:49:36,240 --> 00:49:37,242
[DEVICE BEEPS]

1103
00:49:37,275 --> 00:49:40,312
OOH, RIGHT.
OUR MISSION AND STUFF.

1104
00:49:40,345 --> 00:49:42,847
HEY, WE GOT VISITORS.

1105
00:49:42,880 --> 00:49:44,850
BEARING DOWN AT 235 DEGREES.

1106
00:49:44,883 --> 00:49:47,585
THAT'S SIX DEGREES
OFF THE PORT BEER. I MEAN BOW.

1107
00:49:47,618 --> 00:49:50,988
[LAUGHS]

1108
00:49:51,022 --> 00:49:52,557
HEY, WE'RE WINNING
THE WHITBREAD CUP.

1109
00:49:52,590 --> 00:49:54,292
WHAT IS IT?

1110
00:49:54,325 --> 00:49:55,660
IT'S THE CHALLENGER.

1111
00:49:55,693 --> 00:49:58,697
WEST IS SPYING ON US.

1112
00:49:58,730 --> 00:50:00,498
THINK HE COULD BE AFTER
OUR FRIEND TOO?

1113
00:50:00,532 --> 00:50:03,000
OH, I WOULDN'T
PUT IT PAST HIM.

1114
00:50:03,035 --> 00:50:04,502
HE'S VERY AMBITIOUS.

1115
00:50:04,535 --> 00:50:05,703
HE'D SIT
ON HIS MOTHER'S HEAD

1116
00:50:05,737 --> 00:50:07,038
IF HE HAD SOMETHING
TO GAIN BY IT.

1117
00:50:07,072 --> 00:50:08,507
HOT IMAGE, BOB.

1118
00:50:08,507 --> 00:50:12,010
PETER, I'M NOT GETTING
A SIGNAL FROM BUOY #4 ANYMORE.

1119
00:50:12,043 --> 00:50:13,578
[PETER]
OKAY, HANG ON.

1120
00:50:13,612 --> 00:50:15,613
LOOKS LIKE
A NEW THOMAS DOLBY SONG.

1121
00:50:15,647 --> 00:50:19,417
[GROWLING]

1122
00:50:19,450 --> 00:50:21,387
HM, LITTLE RICH
ON THE BASS THERE.

1123
00:50:25,390 --> 00:50:28,660
WHY COULDN'T I HAVE BEEN
WENDELL COREY?

1124
00:50:28,693 --> 00:50:32,063
LET'S SEE NOW.
HERE'S THE CHURCH.
HERE'S THE STEEPLE.

1125
00:50:32,097 --> 00:50:36,635
OH, DAMN,
I'VE GOT TO PRACTICE.

1126
00:50:36,668 --> 00:50:42,473
I WONDER IF I CAN ORDER
COCKTAILS ONLINE.

1127
00:50:42,507 --> 00:50:45,477
LET'S JUST SEE
WHAT THE CALISTA FLOCKHART
WEB SITE

1128
00:50:45,510 --> 00:50:47,012
HAS TO SAY ABOUT THE SHARK.

1129
00:50:47,045 --> 00:50:48,513
[ELECTRONIC VOICE]
SEA KILLER.

1130
00:50:48,547 --> 00:50:52,483
INFORMATION CLASSIFIED.
ACCESS DENIED.

1131
00:50:52,517 --> 00:50:54,518
THANKS A LOT, STEPHEN HAWKING.

1132
00:50:59,190 --> 00:51:02,327
♪ KARMA KARMA KARMA
KARMA KARMA CHAMELEON ♪

1133
00:51:02,360 --> 00:51:04,763
♪♪ [SOFT ROCK]

1134
00:51:04,797 --> 00:51:07,532
ENJOY THE SOFT-CORE PORN
SOUNDTRACK.

1135
00:51:13,172 --> 00:51:15,773
BEN! BEN!

1136
00:51:19,610 --> 00:51:20,945
MAN, IF HE STOPS SHORT,

1137
00:51:20,978 --> 00:51:25,517
SHE'LL HAVE QUITE A TRAJECTORY.

1138
00:51:25,550 --> 00:51:27,452
PART OF HER JOB DESCRIPTION
IS PROW.

1139
00:51:30,722 --> 00:51:32,823
LET'S HEAD OVER
TO POGO'S PLACE.

1140
00:51:39,965 --> 00:51:43,935
WOW, THEY CAUGHT
A GIANT EYEBALL.

1141
00:51:43,968 --> 00:51:46,538
LOOKS LIKE
IT'S BEEN SABOTAGED.

1142
00:51:46,572 --> 00:51:48,840
BUT WE HAVEN'T SEEN ANY BOATS
FOR THE PAST HOUR.

1143
00:51:48,873 --> 00:51:52,477
HM, BETTER TAKE OFF YOUR SUIT
AND FLAG DOWN SOME HELP.

1144
00:51:52,510 --> 00:51:55,747
YEAH, EXCEPT THE CHALLENGER.

1145
00:51:55,747 --> 00:51:58,250
WE STILL HAVE FOUR AT LEAST.

1146
00:51:58,283 --> 00:51:59,918
IT DOESN'T WORK THAT WAY.

1147
00:51:59,952 --> 00:52:01,185
IN ORDER TO COVER THE FIELD,

1148
00:52:01,218 --> 00:52:03,020
WE'VE GOT TO HAVE ALL FIVE
FUNCTIONING.

1149
00:52:04,823 --> 00:52:06,525
LET'S GET BACK TO THE BOAT.

1150
00:52:06,558 --> 00:52:11,630
THEY'RE HAVING MAMBO LESSONS
ON THE LIDO DECK.

1151
00:52:11,663 --> 00:52:13,865
DIDN'T SHE STAR IN THE NIGHTMARE
BEFORE CHRISTMAS?

1152
00:52:13,898 --> 00:52:16,233
WHAT'S THE MATTER?

1153
00:52:16,267 --> 00:52:18,135
FELT LIKE SOMETHING'S CAUGHT
IN THE PROP.

1154
00:52:18,135 --> 00:52:21,038
THAT'S A PROP?
I THOUGHT IT WAS A REAL MOTOR.

1155
00:52:21,072 --> 00:52:22,207
[PETER]
YEAH, THAT'S ALL WE NEED.

1156
00:52:23,908 --> 00:52:26,210
AH, THE GIANT OCEAN SHAR PEI.

1157
00:52:34,652 --> 00:52:36,020
JANET.

1158
00:52:36,053 --> 00:52:38,122
I GOT THE AMIGA WORKING.

1159
00:52:38,155 --> 00:52:39,557
THIS MAY BE IT.

1160
00:52:39,623 --> 00:52:41,860
YOU'RE GETTING
THE SAME PICTURE?

1161
00:52:41,893 --> 00:52:43,495
I LIKE YOU.

1162
00:52:46,665 --> 00:52:48,032
LOOK AT THAT GUY THERE,

1163
00:52:48,065 --> 00:52:50,668
GRABBING AT HIS OWN EVINRUDE.

1164
00:52:50,702 --> 00:52:53,605
OH, WAIT.

1165
00:52:53,638 --> 00:52:54,572
SEE THE HUMAN LADY.

1166
00:52:57,575 --> 00:52:59,710
YOU HAVEN'T FINISHED?

1167
00:52:59,743 --> 00:53:02,547
YOU DIDN'T EVEN TRY
TO GIVE ME A HAND.

1168
00:53:04,182 --> 00:53:05,717
YOU'VE BEEN LOAFING.

1169
00:53:05,750 --> 00:53:07,952
THAT'S 'CAUSE IT'S SO HOT.

1170
00:53:07,985 --> 00:53:11,155
YEAH. NOT HERE.
COME ON IN.

1171
00:53:11,188 --> 00:53:12,823
YUCK, HE'S TRYING TO BE SEXY.

1172
00:53:16,628 --> 00:53:18,930
YOU KNOW,
SHE DISPLACES NO WATER AT ALL.

1173
00:53:22,333 --> 00:53:24,735
HUH, THIS SCENE
OMITTED FOR CONTENT.

1174
00:53:27,805 --> 00:53:30,008
THE DEVIL FISH INSISTED
THAT IT BE SHOT THROUGH A FILTER

1175
00:53:30,042 --> 00:53:31,542
TO MAKE HIM LOOK YOUNGER.

1176
00:53:34,245 --> 00:53:36,615
I REALLY THINK IT'S HIM.

1177
00:53:36,648 --> 00:53:39,683
IT'S HEADING FOR US.

1178
00:53:39,717 --> 00:53:42,987
HE'S MADE OUT OF POACHED SALMON.

1179
00:53:43,020 --> 00:53:44,755
WHERE ARE PETER AND STELLA?

1180
00:53:44,788 --> 00:53:46,758
THEY'RE OFF BEING SCRAWNY.

1181
00:53:46,792 --> 00:53:48,092
I CAN'T SEE
THEIR BOAT FROM HERE.

1182
00:53:48,125 --> 00:53:49,360
IT'S STRANGE, THOUGH,
THAT THEY--

1183
00:53:49,393 --> 00:53:52,297
[GASPS]
THE DEVIL FISH IS ON THE ROOF.

1184
00:53:52,330 --> 00:53:53,932
THAT'S HIM.

1185
00:53:53,965 --> 00:53:55,633
YES.

1186
00:53:57,902 --> 00:54:00,338
IS HE BRINGING THEM A PIANO?

1187
00:54:00,372 --> 00:54:02,807
WHAT'S HAPPENING?

1188
00:54:02,840 --> 00:54:05,210
IT CHANGED DIRECTION.

1189
00:54:05,243 --> 00:54:07,178
NO, IT'S LEAVING.
COME BACK.

1190
00:54:07,212 --> 00:54:10,448
I'M A RECOVERING ALCOHOLIC.
I CAN'T EAT THAT GUY.

1191
00:54:10,482 --> 00:54:12,217
COME ON, BABY.

1192
00:54:12,250 --> 00:54:13,752
COME BACK, BABY.

1193
00:54:15,887 --> 00:54:21,058
BLAKE EDWARDS, POINT 10.

1194
00:54:21,092 --> 00:54:23,828
CAN ANYONE TELL ME
IF I HAVE A BUTT YET?

1195
00:54:23,862 --> 00:54:25,963
NO, HUH?

1196
00:54:30,002 --> 00:54:35,040
MINOR BOAT INCONVENIENCES
SPLAYED ACROSS THE SCREEN.

1197
00:54:35,073 --> 00:54:37,842
LOOK, HE'S JUST HANGING HIS
EVINRUDE RIGHT OUT THERE
IN THE--

1198
00:54:37,875 --> 00:54:40,678
[MUMBLING]

1199
00:54:45,983 --> 00:54:47,218
HE'S GONE.

1200
00:54:47,252 --> 00:54:51,022
YEAH. HE MUST BE AROUND HERE.

1201
00:54:51,055 --> 00:54:52,823
HE COULDN'T HAVE GONE FAR.

1202
00:54:52,857 --> 00:54:55,160
- WHY NOT?
- BECAUSE I HAVE HIS CAR KEYS.

1203
00:54:55,193 --> 00:54:56,795
I DON'T KNOW.

1204
00:54:56,828 --> 00:54:58,763
I JUST SENSE THAT THESE ARE
HIS NATIVE WATERS.

1205
00:55:00,132 --> 00:55:01,432
WHAT DID I TELL YOU?

1206
00:55:01,465 --> 00:55:03,802
HE'S COMING BACK TO ME.

1207
00:55:06,437 --> 00:55:09,207
NOW IT'S 10 AS REWRITTEN
BY TERRENCE McNALLY.

1208
00:55:11,175 --> 00:55:12,777
LOOK, HE'S BUILT
LIKE A G.I. JOE.

1209
00:55:12,810 --> 00:55:13,945
HE EVEN HAS SHOULDER SOCKETS

1210
00:55:13,978 --> 00:55:15,413
SO YOU CAN POSE HIM.

1211
00:55:18,683 --> 00:55:22,520
[SLOW MOTION VOICE]
I LOVE YOU.

1212
00:55:22,553 --> 00:55:24,188
UH, WHAT?
YOU WANT TO...

1213
00:55:24,222 --> 00:55:26,090
OH, OKAY, JUST DON'T EXPECT ME
TO HELP.

1214
00:55:28,760 --> 00:55:32,097
SO THERE'S A HUGE, GIANT COUPLE
MAKING OUT BEHIND THEM?

1215
00:55:33,832 --> 00:55:35,267
THEY'RE CLONING.

1216
00:55:40,372 --> 00:55:42,507
HEY, THE OTHER US IS GETTING
AHEAD OF US.

1217
00:55:46,277 --> 00:55:48,647
WAKKA-WAKKA-WAKKA-WACKA.

1218
00:55:48,680 --> 00:55:51,115
OW. OW. YOU JUST LAID ME
ON A PUFFER FISH.

1219
00:55:59,923 --> 00:56:02,527
- AS SEEN ON TV.
- ♪♪ [SUSPENSEFUL]

1220
00:56:02,560 --> 00:56:07,098
THEY SIMPLY PLAY
THE JAWS THEME BACKWARDS.

1221
00:56:07,132 --> 00:56:09,200
THE TELECAMERA.

1222
00:56:09,233 --> 00:56:10,535
LOOK AT THE MONITOR.

1223
00:56:10,568 --> 00:56:12,937
IT'S THE BLUE SHOW,
STARRING BLUE.

1224
00:56:12,970 --> 00:56:15,005
- WELL?
- I DON'T SEE ANYTHING.

1225
00:56:15,038 --> 00:56:17,575
IT'S GETTING NEAR.

1226
00:56:17,608 --> 00:56:19,077
IT'S ALMOST OFF THE BOW.

1227
00:56:19,110 --> 00:56:22,313
15 DEGREES TO PORT.

1228
00:56:22,347 --> 00:56:25,583
HI, BLUE HERE.
MY FIRST GUEST IS TEAL.

1229
00:56:25,617 --> 00:56:27,952
BOB, THERE'S SOMETHING
ON THE SCREEN.

1230
00:56:30,053 --> 00:56:30,988
IT'S FLYING TOASTERS.

1231
00:56:32,157 --> 00:56:33,892
- SEE IT?
- YES.

1232
00:56:33,925 --> 00:56:36,460
IT MIGHT BE HIM,
BUT THE PICTURE
ISN'T VERY CLEAR.

1233
00:56:36,493 --> 00:56:38,663
HANG ON.
I'LL GET A LITTLE CLOSER.

1234
00:56:38,697 --> 00:56:40,063
LOOK. LOOK.

1235
00:56:40,098 --> 00:56:43,067
SANDRA BULLOCK
AND CHARLES HAID LOOK ON.

1236
00:56:43,100 --> 00:56:47,372
MY GOD.
BOB, IT'S COMING RIGHT AT US.

1237
00:56:47,405 --> 00:56:49,140
PURE COINCIDENCE,
I ASSURE YOU.

1238
00:56:51,042 --> 00:56:53,010
[BOB]
LOOK AT THAT.

1239
00:56:53,043 --> 00:56:55,980
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.

1240
00:56:56,013 --> 00:56:58,015
LOOK AT THOSE TENTACLES.

1241
00:56:58,048 --> 00:56:59,417
A SHARK WITH TENTACLES.

1242
00:56:59,450 --> 00:57:03,955
PLUS THE GREAT TASTE
OF CHICKEN.

1243
00:57:03,988 --> 00:57:06,090
[GASPS]
COFFEE'S DONE.

1244
00:57:06,123 --> 00:57:07,158
IT'S RIGHT UNDERNEATH US.

1245
00:57:07,192 --> 00:57:08,660
I KNOW!

1246
00:57:08,693 --> 00:57:10,928
WAS THIS GUY DUBBED
BY J. PETERMAN?

1247
00:57:12,997 --> 00:57:15,065
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?
WHAT ARE YOU GOING TO DO?

1248
00:57:15,098 --> 00:57:16,033
I KNOW!

1249
00:57:16,067 --> 00:57:17,935
TRY AND PUT HIM TO SLEEP.

1250
00:57:17,968 --> 00:57:20,070
I'M GOING TO READ HIM
SOMETHING FROM JOAN DIDION.

1251
00:57:25,610 --> 00:57:27,145
IT'S LIKE SHOOTING FISH...

1252
00:57:27,178 --> 00:57:32,050
NOT IN A BARREL.

1253
00:57:32,083 --> 00:57:35,353
SLOWLY I ACTED, STEP BY STEP.

1254
00:57:40,592 --> 00:57:42,327
HEY, YOU GOT A BEER FOR ME?

1255
00:57:42,360 --> 00:57:43,495
STELLA!

1256
00:57:43,528 --> 00:57:46,263
BOB, LOOK OUT!

1257
00:57:46,297 --> 00:57:47,598
I KNOW!

1258
00:57:47,632 --> 00:57:49,667
[SCREAMS]
OH, BOB!

1259
00:57:49,700 --> 00:57:51,335
BEHIND YOU!
LOOK OUT!

1260
00:57:51,368 --> 00:57:52,670
[MONSTER ROARS]

1261
00:57:52,703 --> 00:57:54,438
IT'S SO BIG
IT'S A ELEVEN-TACLE.

1262
00:57:54,472 --> 00:57:57,242
THAT'S YOUR SECOND ONE.

1263
00:57:57,275 --> 00:57:59,077
EVERY TIME I MEET A GUY,

1264
00:57:59,110 --> 00:58:02,513
HE'S MARRIED, GAY,
OR GETTING KILLED
BY A GIANT OCTOPUS.

1265
00:58:02,547 --> 00:58:06,683
MM, HUMAN SUSHI.
I LOVE THIS STUFF.

1266
00:58:06,717 --> 00:58:09,020
SAY GOOD-BYE TO BEER FOR ME.

1267
00:58:13,457 --> 00:58:15,125
ARE THOSE EASY SPIRIT PUMPS?

1268
00:58:20,163 --> 00:58:23,400
OH, SHE NEVER GOT TO WEAR
A HIP BONE REVEALING
BATHING SUIT.

1269
00:58:26,403 --> 00:58:29,273
THIS IS WHY I GOT RID OF MY
MONSTROUSLY LARGE OCTOPUS.

1270
00:58:29,307 --> 00:58:31,142
YEAH. THINK THAT WAS WISE.

1271
00:58:33,477 --> 00:58:34,745
MAN, SHE'S STRONG.

1272
00:58:34,778 --> 00:58:36,113
SHE WORKS OUT AT A GYM

1273
00:58:36,147 --> 00:58:39,317
WHERE SHE
HANGS 5,000-POUND FISH
OFF HER TORSO.

1274
00:58:41,852 --> 00:58:44,655
OW! PLEASE, NO,
THAT'S MY DOMINANT TENTACLE.

1275
00:58:46,790 --> 00:58:48,125
NO, NOT THAT ONE.

1276
00:58:48,158 --> 00:58:51,228
I USE IT TO OPEN LOBSTER CAGES.

1277
00:58:51,262 --> 00:58:53,832
HEH-HEH,
HE'S NEVER FACED
A MEDIOCRE WOMAN

1278
00:58:53,865 --> 00:58:56,533
WITH A SMALL HAND AX BEFORE.

1279
00:59:01,405 --> 00:59:03,207
- BOB?
- RAY?

1280
00:59:07,812 --> 00:59:09,547
YOU KNOW THAT DOOR'S
NOT EVEN RED,

1281
00:59:09,580 --> 00:59:10,782
AND I WANT TO PAINT IT BLACK.

1282
00:59:10,815 --> 00:59:12,250
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT'S WRONG WITH ME.

1283
00:59:12,283 --> 00:59:14,218
IT'S OKAY.

1284
00:59:14,252 --> 00:59:17,222
I FEEL EUROPEAN
UPON SEEING THAT.

1285
00:59:21,192 --> 00:59:23,828
YOU BETTER TAKE OFF YOUR SUIT
AND WIPE THAT UP.

1286
00:59:26,897 --> 00:59:29,733
ONCE AGAIN THERE'S NOODLES
IN BOB'S THROW UP.

1287
00:59:33,237 --> 00:59:34,372
I KNOW OF NO OTHER COURSE

1288
00:59:34,438 --> 00:59:35,740
BUT TO START MAKING OUT AGAIN.

1289
00:59:37,242 --> 00:59:38,342
BOB?

1290
00:59:38,375 --> 00:59:42,813
- [SOBBING]
- I HATE THE WAY YOU SAY "BOB."

1291
00:59:42,847 --> 00:59:44,448
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

1292
00:59:44,482 --> 00:59:45,783
JANET, IT'S ALL RIGHT.

1293
00:59:45,817 --> 00:59:47,385
IT'S ALL RIGHT.
IT'S US.

1294
00:59:47,418 --> 00:59:51,922
I THOUGHT YOU WERE THE OCTOPUS
IN DISGUISE.

1295
00:59:51,957 --> 00:59:55,327
BOB'S BOAT WAS ATTACKED HERE.

1296
00:59:55,360 --> 00:59:58,228
WHOLE DANG THING JUST SITS
IN THAT AREA.

1297
00:59:58,262 --> 00:59:59,797
- MUST LIKE IT.
- THE PERV.

1298
00:59:59,830 --> 01:00:01,765
HOW ARE THEY DOING, CORTEZ?

1299
01:00:01,798 --> 01:00:03,300
THEY HAVEN'T SPOTTED IT YET.

1300
01:00:03,333 --> 01:00:07,338
YEAH, THAT'S WHAT
I WAS AFRAID OF.

1301
01:00:07,372 --> 01:00:09,407
THEY WANT TO COME IN.

1302
01:00:09,440 --> 01:00:11,708
TELL THEM TO SIT TIGHT
UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE.

1303
01:00:11,742 --> 01:00:13,210
YO.

1304
01:00:18,415 --> 01:00:19,683
FANTASTIC.

1305
01:00:19,717 --> 01:00:23,855
YOUR HAIR--
IT SMELLS FANTASTIC.

1306
01:00:23,888 --> 01:00:26,657
HOGAN REALLY HIT
THE JACKPOT THIS TIME.

1307
01:00:26,690 --> 01:00:28,325
SHAME HE'S DEAD.

1308
01:00:28,358 --> 01:00:30,528
MY FILES SHOW IT'S
NOT A SHAME, SIR.

1309
01:00:30,562 --> 01:00:33,163
THE COMPUTER ANALYSIS SAYS
THAT IT'S 40 FEET LONG.

1310
01:00:33,197 --> 01:00:35,165
LUCKY BASTARD.

1311
01:00:35,198 --> 01:00:38,202
ITS JAWS CAN OPEN UP
SIX FEET WIDE.

1312
01:00:38,235 --> 01:00:40,572
AND ITS UNDERWATER SPEED IS
MORE THAN 30 KNOTS.

1313
01:00:40,605 --> 01:00:41,805
ARE THOSE DON KNOTTS?

1314
01:00:41,838 --> 01:00:43,173
THAT'S A REAL TORPEDO.

1315
01:00:43,207 --> 01:00:45,208
SO THAT'S ALL THE INFO, RIGHT?

1316
01:00:45,242 --> 01:00:47,178
THAT'S ALL?

1317
01:00:47,212 --> 01:00:48,345
DON'T YOU UNDERSTAND

1318
01:00:48,378 --> 01:00:50,382
THAT THIS DATA ALONE

1319
01:00:50,415 --> 01:00:53,550
IS ENOUGH FOR US TO CLAIM
A MAJOR SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY.

1320
01:00:53,583 --> 01:00:56,287
ALL I WANT TO KNOW
IS HOW DO YOU CATCH IT?

1321
01:00:56,320 --> 01:00:57,588
FROM DEEP-MOUTH KISSING.

1322
01:00:57,622 --> 01:01:00,290
I MIGHT HAVE AN IDEA.

1323
01:01:00,323 --> 01:01:02,260
DOESN'T ALL ANIMAL LIFE

1324
01:01:02,293 --> 01:01:04,228
RESPOND TO THE CALLS
OF ITS OWN KIND?

1325
01:01:04,262 --> 01:01:06,730
YOU SEEM TO FORGET WE'RE DEALING
WITH ONE OF A KIND.

1326
01:01:06,763 --> 01:01:09,300
IT'S AMAZING IT SURVIVED
AT ALL.

1327
01:01:09,333 --> 01:01:11,568
WOULD MY GOOD LOOKS HELP
IN ANY WAY?

1328
01:01:11,602 --> 01:01:13,370
I'VE RECORDED ITS VOICE

1329
01:01:13,403 --> 01:01:16,373
AND CAN REPRODUCE IT
WITH ONLY SLIGHT MODULATIONS.

1330
01:01:16,407 --> 01:01:17,475
CLOSE ENOUGH TO MAKE IT THINK

1331
01:01:17,508 --> 01:01:19,510
THAT THE SOUNDS
OF ONE OF ITS OWN SPECIES.

1332
01:01:19,543 --> 01:01:21,712
THAT'LL COME MADE
WITH OUR BOAT.

1333
01:01:21,778 --> 01:01:23,247
I DON'T THINK IT'LL WORK.

1334
01:01:23,280 --> 01:01:24,615
I'D LIKE TO TRY IT.

1335
01:01:24,648 --> 01:01:27,285
MAN, WHAT AN ELECTRICIAN LOVER.

1336
01:01:27,318 --> 01:01:30,253
YEAH, A MILLION YEARS
OF SOLITUDE IS A LONG TIME.

1337
01:01:30,287 --> 01:01:32,290
I'LL BE HE'S JUST DYING
TO BULL WITH SOMEONE.

1338
01:01:32,323 --> 01:01:33,557
YOU KNOW WHAT I THINK?

1339
01:01:33,590 --> 01:01:35,025
YOU'RE BEING RIDICULOUS.

1340
01:01:35,058 --> 01:01:37,295
DAVID. TAKE A LOOK.

1341
01:01:37,328 --> 01:01:39,397
HERE ARE THE FIRST FINDINGS
ON THE LAB ANALYSIS

1342
01:01:39,430 --> 01:01:40,832
WE RAN
ON THE ANIMAL'S TENTACLE.

1343
01:01:40,865 --> 01:01:43,300
OH, HEY,
IT'S A HOOCHIE-COOCHIE FIST.

1344
01:01:43,367 --> 01:01:47,438
IT HAS A PRIMORDIAL BIOLOGICAL
STRUCTURE,

1345
01:01:47,472 --> 01:01:48,740
EXTREMELY RESISTANT.

1346
01:01:48,773 --> 01:01:51,808
AVERAGE AGE OF CELLS...

1347
01:01:51,842 --> 01:01:53,778
[ELECTRONIC VOICE]
EIGHT MONTHS.

1348
01:01:53,812 --> 01:01:56,513
OH, MY GOD, IS THAT POSSIBLE?

1349
01:01:56,547 --> 01:01:58,382
EIGHT MONTHS?

1350
01:01:58,415 --> 01:02:02,653
THE CELLS OF THIS CREATURE
HAVE A LIFE OF...

1351
01:02:02,687 --> 01:02:05,423
ONLY EIGHT MONTHS?

1352
01:02:05,457 --> 01:02:07,625
I'M GONNA KICK YOUR ASS.

1353
01:02:07,658 --> 01:02:09,027
I DON'T BELIEVE IT.

1354
01:02:09,060 --> 01:02:11,295
YOU MEAN THAT THAT MONSTER

1355
01:02:11,328 --> 01:02:13,297
IS NOTHING BUT A PUP?

1356
01:02:14,432 --> 01:02:17,302
[CHATTERING]

1357
01:02:17,335 --> 01:02:19,037
SHOULD WE HAVE TIED
THIS STUFF DOWN?

1358
01:02:19,070 --> 01:02:20,605
I MEAN, IT IS EXPLOSIVE.

1359
01:02:20,638 --> 01:02:22,307
[GROANS]

1360
01:02:27,978 --> 01:02:29,847
ORSON WELLES TOILET FLOAT.

1361
01:02:36,653 --> 01:02:38,388
[MAN ON PHONE]
WE WANT A NICE CLEAN JOB.

1362
01:02:38,422 --> 01:02:41,025
THEY HAVE TO BE STOPPED
AT ALL COSTS.

1363
01:02:41,058 --> 01:02:42,360
- OKAY.
- GOT IT?

1364
01:02:42,393 --> 01:02:43,493
STOPPED AT ALL COSTS.

1365
01:02:43,527 --> 01:02:45,395
USE YOUR FACE IF NECESSARY.

1366
01:02:45,428 --> 01:02:48,432
HEY, SHERIFF, THEY KILLED
THAT GIRL, SANDRA HAYES.

1367
01:02:48,465 --> 01:02:49,800
SHE WORKED FOR PETER.

1368
01:02:49,833 --> 01:02:51,402
YOU KNOW WHERE
THEY MURDERED HER?

1369
01:02:51,435 --> 01:02:52,737
HARRISON BAY.

1370
01:02:52,770 --> 01:02:55,105
I'M WINDED.
I RAN ALL THE WAY FROM GNC.

1371
01:02:55,138 --> 01:02:58,508
I HAD CONSIDERED QUITTING.
I WAS BORED.

1372
01:02:58,542 --> 01:03:01,312
NOW THERE ARE PEOPLE
GETTING KILLED LIKE FLIES,

1373
01:03:01,345 --> 01:03:02,947
RIGHT IN FRONT OF MY NOSE.

1374
01:03:02,980 --> 01:03:05,315
SHERIFF,
I THINK THERE'S A CONNECTION
BETWEEN THESE DEATHS

1375
