01:15:09,640 --> 01:15:11,040
[GUN FIRES]

1600
01:15:11,073 --> 01:15:13,543
MR. GOLD MEDAL, COME ON.

1601
01:15:19,448 --> 01:15:22,085
NOT MY BALLOON!

1602
01:15:24,053 --> 01:15:27,190
PROJECT SEA KILLER
CLASSIFICATION-- TOP SECRET.

1603
01:15:27,223 --> 01:15:30,793
ANIMAL HAS BEEN PROGRAMMED
TO CONTROL DESIGNATED AREA.

1604
01:15:30,827 --> 01:15:36,132
[IMITATING COMPUTER]

1605
01:15:36,165 --> 01:15:38,602
...TEST SUSPENDED AUGUST '84.

1606
01:15:38,635 --> 01:15:40,303
CAUSE-- AUTO PROTOTYP--

1607
01:15:40,337 --> 01:15:42,772
TIP, TIP, TYPE...
[STAMMERING]

1608
01:15:42,805 --> 01:15:45,242
MAN, JUST WANTED
TO PLAY FREECELL.

1609
01:15:45,275 --> 01:15:49,212
PROJECT ORIGINATOR--
DR. DAVIS.

1610
01:15:49,245 --> 01:15:51,382
- DAVIS, DAVIS, DAVIS...
- DAVIS, DAVIS, DAVIS?

1611
01:15:51,415 --> 01:15:53,750
UNORIGINAL PARENTS.

1612
01:15:53,783 --> 01:15:55,185
OW.

1613
01:15:59,088 --> 01:16:00,423
I WILL SEEK MY REVENGE,

1614
01:16:00,457 --> 01:16:03,127
BUT FIRST I'M GOING TO SNAG ME
A CHARLESTON CHEW.

1615
01:16:05,828 --> 01:16:07,163
YEAH, I'M GOING TO GO
TO THE STACKS

1616
01:16:07,197 --> 01:16:11,233
AND LEAF THROUGH
OLD LIFE MAGAZINES.

1617
01:16:11,268 --> 01:16:14,672
- HOLD IT.
- YOU HAVE OVERDUE BOOKS.

1618
01:16:14,705 --> 01:16:17,340
I SEE YOU'VE FINALLY DISCOVERED
THE TRUTH, DR. WEST.

1619
01:16:17,373 --> 01:16:19,677
LET'S SAY MY SUSPICIONS
ARE NOW CONFIRMED.

1620
01:16:19,710 --> 01:16:21,745
HOWEVER, I'D LIKE TO KNOW
WHY YOU'VE PERSISTED

1621
01:16:21,778 --> 01:16:23,413
IN SPITE OF MY OPPOSITION.

1622
01:16:23,447 --> 01:16:25,348
BECAUSE OUR FUTURE
IS IN THE SEA.

1623
01:16:25,382 --> 01:16:26,517
ANYONE WHO HAS THE CHANCE

1624
01:16:26,550 --> 01:16:28,718
TO TAP THE TREMENDOUS RESERVES
OF THE SEA

1625
01:16:28,752 --> 01:16:30,453
WILL HAVE THE FUTURE, DOCTOR.

1626
01:16:30,487 --> 01:16:32,255
- IN HIS HANDS.
- EXACTLY.

1627
01:16:32,288 --> 01:16:33,523
THANKS FOR HELPING ME
OUT THERE.

1628
01:16:33,557 --> 01:16:35,192
WHY CREATE SUCH A MONSTER?

1629
01:16:35,225 --> 01:16:38,395
WHAT BETTER WAY
TO PROTECT AND EXPLOITABLE AREA

1630
01:16:38,428 --> 01:16:40,830
THAN A MARINE MONSTER
ALMOST INDESTRUCTIBLE

1631
01:16:40,863 --> 01:16:42,698
AND WHOSE GENETIC
CHARACTERISTICS

1632
01:16:42,732 --> 01:16:45,635
ARE AS FEARSOME
AS THE WHITE SHARK'S?
- ♪♪ [HUMMING JAWS THEME]

1633
01:16:45,668 --> 01:16:46,803
A GIGANTIC OCTOPUS

1634
01:16:46,837 --> 01:16:48,505
WITH THE INTELLIGENCE
OF A DOLPHIN

1635
01:16:48,505 --> 01:16:52,408
AND AS MONSTROUS
AS A PREHISTORIC CREATURE.

1636
01:16:52,442 --> 01:16:53,677
YOU'RE MAD.

1637
01:16:53,710 --> 01:16:56,780
NO, YOU'RE THE ONE WHO'S MAD.

1638
01:16:56,813 --> 01:16:58,482
SONJA, PLEASE.

1639
01:16:58,515 --> 01:17:01,318
BECAUSE YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND
OUR MAGNIFICENT CREATION

1640
01:17:01,352 --> 01:17:03,520
AND WHAT IT WILL MEAN
TO THE COMPANY.

1641
01:17:03,553 --> 01:17:05,488
- THE W.O.I...
- WOI.

1642
01:17:05,522 --> 01:17:07,723
...HAS ONLY ONE OBJECTIVE--
PROFITS.

1643
01:17:07,757 --> 01:17:09,693
DON'T FORGET THAT.

1644
01:17:09,727 --> 01:17:12,728
LOOK, FROM A WOMAN WHO HAS
THE SENSITIVITY OF A SLUT

1645
01:17:12,762 --> 01:17:13,963
TO THE POINT OF GIVING
HER LOVER

1646
01:17:13,997 --> 01:17:15,365
THE IDENTICAL WATCH
SHE GAVE HER HUSBAND

1647
01:17:15,398 --> 01:17:16,500
FOR AN ANNIVERSARY PRESENT,

1648
01:17:16,533 --> 01:17:17,900
I WILL NOT ACCEPT LESS THAN...

1649
01:17:17,933 --> 01:17:21,405
I'M SORRY.
IT'S A VERY NICE WATCH.

1650
01:17:21,438 --> 01:17:23,273
THAT MONSTER

1651
01:17:23,307 --> 01:17:25,308
HAS ALREADY CAUSED THE DEATH

1652
01:17:25,342 --> 01:17:27,410
OF A NUMBER OF INNOCENT PEOPLE,

1653
01:17:27,443 --> 01:17:30,313
AND I DOUBT IT WILL EVER
BECOME A MEANS

1654
01:17:30,347 --> 01:17:32,282
OF PROFIT TO ANYBODY.

1655
01:17:32,282 --> 01:17:34,852
IT WON'T SUCCEED.

1656
01:17:34,885 --> 01:17:36,653
IT'LL BE EASIER
THAN YOU THINK,

1657
01:17:36,687 --> 01:17:38,555
AND YOU WON'T BE ABLE
TO STOP US.

1658
01:17:38,588 --> 01:17:39,823
SO NEH.

1659
01:17:39,857 --> 01:17:41,625
IN 12 HOURS

1660
01:17:41,658 --> 01:17:43,327
THAT CREATURE'S
CELLULAR STRUCTURE

1661
01:17:43,360 --> 01:17:44,762
WILL BEGIN TO DISINTEGRATE,

1662
01:17:44,795 --> 01:17:46,730
AND THE SEAS WILL BE POPULATED

1663
01:17:46,763 --> 01:17:47,963
BY IDENTICAL CREATURES

1664
01:17:47,997 --> 01:17:49,833
THAT WILL CONTINUE
TO REPRODUCE THEMSELVES

1665
01:17:49,867 --> 01:17:51,200
INDEFINITELY

1666
01:17:51,233 --> 01:17:53,270
UNTIL THE OCEANS
THE WORLD OVER

1667
01:17:53,270 --> 01:17:54,838
WILL BE TOTALLY DOMINATED
BY THEM.

1668
01:17:54,872 --> 01:17:56,305
YOU'RE ENVIOUS.

1669
01:17:56,338 --> 01:17:59,275
THE TRUTH IS YOU'VE BECOME
TOO OLD, WEST,

1670
01:17:59,308 --> 01:18:00,710
TOO OLD FOR SCIENCE,

1671
01:18:00,743 --> 01:18:02,312
TOO OLD FOR YOUR WIFE.

1672
01:18:02,345 --> 01:18:03,513
DON'T MOVE, DAVIS.

1673
01:18:05,448 --> 01:18:08,552
PRE-DRIED,
IMMEDIATELY SPREAD BLOOD.

1674
01:18:08,585 --> 01:18:12,288
- DAVIS!
- BUT HE DID SAY, "DON'T MOVE."

1675
01:18:12,322 --> 01:18:15,392
YOU'LL NEVER STOP HIM.

1676
01:18:15,458 --> 01:18:16,727
YOU'LL NEVER BE ABLE...

1677
01:18:16,760 --> 01:18:20,563
OH, MAN,
EVEN IN DEATH HE WON'T SHUT UP.

1678
01:18:20,597 --> 01:18:25,335
YOU WON'T EVER BE ABLE

1679
01:18:25,368 --> 01:18:28,505
TO DESTROY MY CREATURE.

1680
01:18:28,538 --> 01:18:31,007
PLEASE, FRANCISCO FRANCO
DIED QUICKER.

1681
01:18:34,812 --> 01:18:36,278
CAN THIS MARRIAGE BE SAVED?

1682
01:18:36,312 --> 01:18:37,513
IT'S NOT MY FAULT!

1683
01:18:37,547 --> 01:18:38,982
- [SHERIFF] CORTEZ.
- [CORTEZ] YEAH.

1684
01:18:39,015 --> 01:18:40,350
IT WAS HIS IDEA.

1685
01:18:40,383 --> 01:18:41,852
- NO!
- OKAY, LADY.

1686
01:18:41,885 --> 01:18:43,453
IT'S NOT MY FAULT!

1687
01:18:43,487 --> 01:18:45,022
IT AIN'T MINE EITHER,
SO LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

1688
01:18:45,055 --> 01:18:47,423
HOW LONG HAD YOU BEEN
STANDING THERE, SHERIFF?

1689
01:18:47,457 --> 01:18:49,525
I GOT HER JUST IN TIME

1690
01:18:49,558 --> 01:18:51,962
TO HEAR WHO THE MANIAC WAS
BEHIND ALL THIS.

1691
01:18:51,995 --> 01:18:53,028
IT'S RICHARD JEWELL.

1692
01:18:53,062 --> 01:18:55,332
WE HAVE ONE POSSIBILITY,
SHERIFF.

1693
01:18:55,365 --> 01:18:57,567
OH, REALLY?
WHAT'S THAT?

1694
01:18:57,600 --> 01:18:59,435
- FIRE.
- ♪♪ [HUMS ARTHUR BROWN'S
"FIRE"]

1695
01:18:59,468 --> 01:19:01,938
THOSE CELLS CAN BE DESTROYED
BY FIRE.

1696
01:19:01,972 --> 01:19:03,740
HOW ARE WE GOING
TO BURN A MONSTER

1697
01:19:03,773 --> 01:19:05,375
HIDING AT THE BOTTOM
OF THE SEA?

1698
01:19:05,408 --> 01:19:07,443
LURE IT TO THE SURFACE.

1699
01:19:07,477 --> 01:19:08,912
TO THE SURFACE?

1700
01:19:08,945 --> 01:19:11,615
OF COURSE.
PETER CAN DO IT WITH
A TAPE RECORDER.

1701
01:19:11,648 --> 01:19:13,015
WE TRIED IT AND IT WORKS.

1702
01:19:14,550 --> 01:19:16,352
OKAY, IT'S WORTH A TRY.

1703
01:19:16,385 --> 01:19:17,920
REMEMBER,
THERE'S VERY LITTLE TIME,

1704
01:19:17,953 --> 01:19:19,588
PERHAPS LESS THAN EIGHT HOURS.

1705
01:19:19,622 --> 01:19:23,092
SO LET'S GET OUR FASTEST BOAT
ON THE PROJECT.

1706
01:19:27,697 --> 01:19:29,632
ISN'T ANYBODY HERE
GOING TO BRIBE ME?

1707
01:19:33,437 --> 01:19:35,438
[FOREIGN ACCENT]
COME ON.
I NEED TO CONTACT EUROPE.

1708
01:19:42,645 --> 01:19:44,613
MIKE, HOW COME YOU DON'T HAVE
HUGE RUBBER PANTS?

1709
01:19:44,647 --> 01:19:46,583
WHO SAYS I DON'T?

1710
01:19:46,617 --> 01:19:47,917
- OW.
- YOW.

1711
01:19:52,122 --> 01:19:53,257
WATCH IT!

1712
01:19:54,858 --> 01:19:58,060
♪ GET YOUR FLAMETHROWERS OUT,
GRAB A STICK OF JUICYFRUIT ♪

1713
01:20:01,798 --> 01:20:05,135
ATTENTION.
FREE DEVIL FISH FOOD.

1714
01:20:07,703 --> 01:20:10,107
FARRAH FAWCETT MINOR.

1715
01:20:11,975 --> 01:20:13,510
OKAY, SEE ANYTHING YET, STELLA?

1716
01:20:13,543 --> 01:20:15,178
WHAT'S ON THE SCREEN?

1717
01:20:15,212 --> 01:20:16,747
NEGATIVE.

1718
01:20:16,780 --> 01:20:20,483
- WHAT DO YOU MEAN, NEGATIVE?
- ALL RIGHT, KEEP CALLING HIM.

1719
01:20:26,857 --> 01:20:28,558
THE OX-FISH INCIDENT.

1720
01:20:28,592 --> 01:20:30,493
SHERIFF GORDON HERE.
YOU READ ME?

1721
01:20:30,527 --> 01:20:32,595
- NEGATIVE.
- WHAT IS IT, SHERIFF?

1722
01:20:32,628 --> 01:20:35,498
WE'RE GETTING READY TO GIVE
A NICE LITTLE RECEPTION.

1723
01:20:35,532 --> 01:20:37,733
GET IT TO SURFACE
HERE IN THE CANAL
AND WE'LL SNARE IT.

1724
01:20:37,767 --> 01:20:39,035
- YEAH.
- SURE, WHATEVER.

1725
01:20:39,068 --> 01:20:40,503
MORNING.

1726
01:20:40,537 --> 01:20:41,538
HOW'S IT GOING?

1727
01:20:41,572 --> 01:20:43,005
THE MEN HAVE TAKEN UP
THEIR POSITION.

1728
01:20:43,038 --> 01:20:44,707
MAKE SURE EVERYTHING
IS CHECKED OUT.

1729
01:20:44,740 --> 01:20:46,643
I DON'T WANT ANY GOOF-UPS
WHEN THE TIME COMES.

1730
01:20:46,677 --> 01:20:47,843
GOOFUS?

1731
01:20:51,582 --> 01:20:53,550
FREE COUPONS
TO DEVIL FISH WORLD.

1732
01:20:57,687 --> 01:20:59,588
OOH, GINGIVITIS.

1733
01:21:02,992 --> 01:21:04,995
THAT'S HIM.
OKAY.

1734
01:21:05,028 --> 01:21:07,163
NO, WAIT.
THAT'S HIS BROTHER.
THEY LOOK A LOT ALIKE.

1735
01:21:07,230 --> 01:21:08,698
WE'RE COMING IN, SHERIFF.

1736
01:21:08,732 --> 01:21:12,102
FINALLY. YOU'RE AROUND
A MILE AND A HALF FROM HERE.

1737
01:21:12,135 --> 01:21:15,072
OKAY, WE'LL STOP,
AND I'LL BOARD THE TENDER.

1738
01:21:15,105 --> 01:21:17,873
TELL THE CHOPPER PILOT TO BE
ON THE READY, SHERIFF.

1739
01:21:17,907 --> 01:21:19,542
WE'RE LEADING HIM IN.

1740
01:21:19,575 --> 01:21:21,277
I'LL BE ON THE CHOPPER MYSELF,
PETER.

1741
01:21:21,310 --> 01:21:22,712
OVER AND OUT.

1742
01:21:25,215 --> 01:21:26,917
IF I DON'T COME BACK,

1743
01:21:26,950 --> 01:21:30,253
ADOPT A SINGLE CURRENCY,
EAT SNAILS, AND DON'T SHAVE
YOUR ARM PITS.

1744
01:21:39,662 --> 01:21:41,430
READY TO TURN OFF
YOUR TAPE CALL.

1745
01:21:41,463 --> 01:21:42,532
OKAY.

1746
01:21:42,565 --> 01:21:44,400
NOW.

1747
01:21:44,433 --> 01:21:47,037
I'M JUST GOING TO TURN
EVERYTHING OFF.
THAT'S EASIER.

1748
01:21:50,507 --> 01:21:52,442
HEY, GRITS GRESHAM.
ANYWAY.

1749
01:21:55,612 --> 01:21:56,813
THE SHIP'S HAVING SHIPLETS.

1750
01:21:59,682 --> 01:22:03,287
OKAY, PETER, IT'S BEHIND YOU.

1751
01:22:03,320 --> 01:22:06,288
YOU THINK THE COAST GUARD
WOULD BE IN MY NIECE'S
HIGH-SCHOOL PLAY?

1752
01:22:06,322 --> 01:22:07,590
- SURE.
- IN A MINUTE.

1753
01:22:07,623 --> 01:22:09,525
NICE GOING, PETER.

1754
01:22:09,558 --> 01:22:11,060
RIGHT ON COURSE.

1755
01:22:11,093 --> 01:22:13,297
AHEAD OF YOU,
YOU'LL SEE THE INLET.

1756
01:22:13,330 --> 01:22:16,265
I'M PETER, AND AHEAD OF ME
I SEE THE INLET.

1757
01:22:21,237 --> 01:22:22,672
AS SEEN ON TV.

1758
01:22:23,840 --> 01:22:25,242
WHERE IS THAT?

1759
01:22:25,275 --> 01:22:26,275
BE CAREFUL, PETER.

1760
01:22:26,308 --> 01:22:28,645
IT'S GETTING TOO CLOSE.
GO FASTER.

1761
01:22:28,678 --> 01:22:31,782
NO, I WON'T BE CAREFUL,
AND I'LL GO SLOWER.

1762
01:22:34,383 --> 01:22:37,120
FOLLOW ME FOR FREE DEVIL FISH
MARSHMALLOW TREATS.

1763
01:22:42,792 --> 01:22:45,162
IT'S DON EVINRUDE
AND SONNY CROCKETT.

1764
01:22:45,195 --> 01:22:46,395
OH, I DID IT AGAIN, DIDN'T I?

1765
01:22:46,428 --> 01:22:49,298
- YEAH.
- IT'S JUST NOT FIRING.

1766
01:22:49,332 --> 01:22:50,333
I'M COMING IN.

1767
01:22:50,367 --> 01:22:52,768
CORTEZ'S MEN,
BE ON THE READY.

1768
01:22:52,802 --> 01:22:54,603
...CREW ON STAND-BYE.

1769
01:22:54,637 --> 01:22:56,472
LET GO OF
THE LIGHT SURFACE FIRES.

1770
01:22:56,505 --> 01:22:57,573
GO ON IN.

1771
01:22:57,607 --> 01:23:02,278
DEPLOY THE COUNTRY TIME
PINK LEMONADE.

1772
01:23:02,312 --> 01:23:05,215
BET THEY HIRED EVERY
NATURE-HATING PSYCHO
IN DADE COUNTY.

1773
01:23:10,353 --> 01:23:13,255
WHAT A FUN, FESTIVE WAY
TO HAVE A FISH BOIL.

1774
01:23:19,962 --> 01:23:22,765
PETER, THE THING'S
ON TOP OF YOU.

1775
01:23:22,798 --> 01:23:24,733
NOT UNLIKE YOU AND I EARLIER.

1776
01:23:26,937 --> 01:23:28,572
THAT'S HIS ANSWER
TO EVERYTHING.

1777
01:23:30,240 --> 01:23:31,473
AS SEEN ON TV.

1778
01:23:34,277 --> 01:23:36,847
I'M IN THE MOOD
FOR A LITTLE ITALIAN.

1779
01:23:41,417 --> 01:23:43,887
- PETER.
- I HAVE A TUMMY ACHE.

1780
01:23:47,690 --> 01:23:49,825
PETER, WHERE'RE LOWERING
A HARNESS.

1781
01:23:49,858 --> 01:23:53,262
IT'S REAL SEXY.
WE WANT YOU TO TRY IT ON.

1782
01:23:57,567 --> 01:24:00,002
HOIST! HOIST!

1783
01:24:00,035 --> 01:24:01,570
CHEEK SKI. WHOO!

1784
01:24:07,410 --> 01:24:08,578
WELL, THIS IS FLORIDA.

1785
01:24:08,612 --> 01:24:10,247
MAYBE SOME FRESH CUBANS
WILL DO.

1786
01:24:14,950 --> 01:24:16,385
WHOA, DID I SEE A...?

1787
01:24:17,553 --> 01:24:20,423
UH, YEP, YEP, YEP,
WE HAVE BIKE RACK.

1788
01:24:20,457 --> 01:24:22,458
WHOO-HOO!

1789
01:24:22,492 --> 01:24:23,893
IT'S HARPO.

1790
01:24:26,963 --> 01:24:31,433
YEP, I SHOULD EMPTY
THESE PANTS SOON.

1791
01:24:32,635 --> 01:24:34,637
SO WE'VE ONLY GOT
A FEW HOURS LEFT.

1792
01:24:34,670 --> 01:24:37,340
AND I WANTED TO FEEL
YOUR EMBRACE BEFORE WE DIE.

1793
01:24:37,373 --> 01:24:39,375
SQUAD NUMBER ONE,
DO YOU READ ME?

1794
01:24:39,408 --> 01:24:42,412
SQUAD NUMBER ONE, SHERIFF.
AIN'T SEEN NOTHING YET.

1795
01:24:42,445 --> 01:24:45,047
B-B-B-BABY, WE AIN'T SEEN
NOTHING YET. OVER.

1796
01:24:45,080 --> 01:24:46,783
REPORT IN, SQUAD NUMBER TWO.

1797
01:24:46,817 --> 01:24:48,685
SQUAD NUMBER TWO,
COME IN, PLEASE.

1798
01:24:48,718 --> 01:24:50,687
HM?

1799
01:24:50,720 --> 01:24:51,955
SQUAD NUMBER TWO.

1800
01:24:51,988 --> 01:24:56,458
♪♪ [HUMS "DUELING BANJOS"]

1801
01:24:56,492 --> 01:24:58,862
A FEW CRACKERS
FOR AN APPETIZER.

1802
01:25:02,698 --> 01:25:04,467
CHOMP.

1803
01:25:04,500 --> 01:25:06,837
SQUAD NUMBER TWO.
SQUAD NUMBER TWO.

1804
01:25:06,870 --> 01:25:08,403
WE DONE BEEN HIT.
OVER.

1805
01:25:08,437 --> 01:25:10,640
SQUAD NUMBER TWO,
COME IN PLEASE.

1806
01:25:10,673 --> 01:25:13,477
THEY'LL BE NUMBER TWO
SOON ENOUGH.

1807
01:25:13,510 --> 01:25:16,412
COME ON.
LET'S GO.

1808
01:25:16,445 --> 01:25:18,582
SQUAD NUMBER TWO
DOESN'T ANSWER.

1809
01:25:18,615 --> 01:25:20,383
GET ON. QUICK.

1810
01:25:20,417 --> 01:25:22,952
BARRY SWITZER
CROSSES THE DELAWARE.

1811
01:25:24,053 --> 01:25:25,722
THIS IS HOW I LIKE TO FISH,
MATE.

1812
01:25:25,755 --> 01:25:29,492
A FLASH LIGHT
AND A FLAME THROWER.

1813
01:25:29,525 --> 01:25:32,695
YOU KNOW, I DON'T NEED
NEIL YOUNG AROUND ANYHOW.

1814
01:25:34,163 --> 01:25:35,498
HERE, BOY.

1815
01:25:41,003 --> 01:25:42,772
MY HEART WILL GO ON.

1816
01:25:45,908 --> 01:25:50,713
♪ SOUTHERN MAN,
GONNA EAT YOUR HEAD ♪

1817
01:25:53,115 --> 01:25:55,718
LOT OF GUYS NAMED BO
WERE KILLED THAT DAY.

1818
01:26:00,490 --> 01:26:03,492
SO I GUESS WE FIND OUT
WHAT THE SOUTH
IS GONNA DO AGAIN--

1819
01:26:03,527 --> 01:26:06,495
GET EATEN BY A HUGE FISH.

1820
01:26:09,565 --> 01:26:10,967
GIVE ME YOUR HAND.
GIVE ME YOUR HAND.

1821
01:26:11,000 --> 01:26:12,602
NO, JUST THE HAND.

1822
01:26:12,635 --> 01:26:14,470
IT'S OKAY.
IT'S OKAY.

1823
01:26:14,503 --> 01:26:16,572
THE GAS!
POUR OUT THE GAS!

1824
01:26:16,605 --> 01:26:20,477
ALL SQUADS,
EMPTY OUT CONTAINERS.

1825
01:26:20,510 --> 01:26:22,612
WELL, THIS SHOULD TAKE CARE
OF EVERY LIVING THING

1826
01:26:22,645 --> 01:26:24,213
IN THE EVERGLADES.

1827
01:26:24,247 --> 01:26:26,115
YEAH.

1828
01:26:29,918 --> 01:26:32,055
FLAME THROWERS, IGNITE.

1829
01:26:32,122 --> 01:26:36,492
HERE, TRY MY CIGAR LIGHTER.

1830
01:26:39,895 --> 01:26:42,632
OKAY, NOW THROW IN
THE DICED ONIONS AND CELERY

1831
01:26:42,665 --> 01:26:45,802
AND CHOPPED
PORCINI MUSHROOMS.

1832
01:26:45,835 --> 01:26:48,638
DOES THE COAST GUARD
HAVE A LOT OF USE
FOR FLAME THROWERS?

1833
01:26:51,840 --> 01:26:54,010
AND THE CRY OF "OPA" RINGS OUT.

1834
01:26:56,712 --> 01:26:57,980
ALL RIGHT, MEN.
SEE IF HE'S DONE.

1835
01:26:58,013 --> 01:26:59,748
TRY FLAKING HIM WITH A FORK.

1836
01:27:02,785 --> 01:27:06,555
THE SHERIFF'S OFFICIAL REPORT
SIMPLY READ, "ICK."

1837
01:27:10,092 --> 01:27:11,793
[SNIFFS]
MM.

1838
01:27:11,827 --> 01:27:14,997
SOMEONE THREW A MATCH
ON THE CUYAHOGA RIVER.

1839
01:27:16,665 --> 01:27:18,200
♪♪ [HUMS "OH SUSANNAH"]

1840
01:27:18,233 --> 01:27:22,038
- OH.
- NO.

1841
01:27:22,072 --> 01:27:26,875
AAH! IT'S STARTING OVER.
NO!

1842
01:27:26,908 --> 01:27:28,745
WHAT IS THAT?
THERE'S NOTHING THERE.

1843
01:27:28,778 --> 01:27:31,313
YOU SHOULD START SEEING
MOTORCYCLES, MIKE.

1844
01:27:31,447 --> 01:27:33,148
- VERY NICE, YOU GUYS.
- THANK YOU.

1845
01:27:33,950 --> 01:27:35,352
I'M FINALLY GETTING
MY VACATION.

1846
01:27:35,385 --> 01:27:36,987
WHERE ARE WE GOING?

1847
01:27:37,020 --> 01:27:40,122
TO THE MOUNTAINS.

1848
01:27:40,155 --> 01:27:42,392
[MOCK LAUGHS]
WE ARE FROM EUROPE.

1849
01:27:42,425 --> 01:27:44,560
[ALL MOCK LAUGHING]

1850
01:27:51,200 --> 01:27:53,970
[LAUGHTER CONTINUING]

1851
01:28:28,003 --> 01:28:29,538
[CONTINUING]

1852
01:29:06,508 --> 01:29:09,245
OKAY. OH, THAT'S--

1853
01:29:09,278 --> 01:29:12,248
THAT'S--
THAT'S GOOD, YOU GUYS.

1854
01:29:25,862 --> 01:29:27,230
WELL, ANYWAY, MIKE.

1855
01:29:27,263 --> 01:29:29,432
I THINK W.O.I.
WAS ON THE RIGHT TRACK,

1856
01:29:29,465 --> 01:29:30,700
ATTEMPTING TO RAISE PROFITS

1857
01:29:30,733 --> 01:29:32,435
BY COMBINING A SHARK
AND AN OCTOPUS.

1858
01:29:32,468 --> 01:29:35,037
I JUST THINK IT MAY HAVE BEEN
THE WRONG COMBINATION.

1859
01:29:35,070 --> 01:29:37,140
I MEAN, WHAT ABOUT COMBINING
A POODLE AND A FLY?

1860
01:29:37,173 --> 01:29:38,742
NO, NO, NO, NOT QUITE YET.

1861
01:29:38,775 --> 01:29:40,142
WHAT ABOUT A SNAIL
AND A PARROT?

1862
01:29:40,175 --> 01:29:41,643
NO, CLOSE BUT NOT THERE.

1863
01:29:41,677 --> 01:29:44,147
WHAT ABOUT YOU, SERVO?
WHAT WOULD YOU COMBINE?

1864
01:29:44,147 --> 01:29:48,183
WHO, ME? I THINK I'LL COMBINE
A LICK AND A ME AND
SHIP IT RIGHT OVER TO YOU.

1865
01:29:48,217 --> 01:29:51,120
- NOW, COME ON NOW.
- WHAT THE HECK DOES HE CARE
ANYWAY?

1866
01:29:51,153 --> 01:29:53,155
I JUST THINK THAT
WAS COMPLETELY UNCALLED FOR.

1867
01:29:53,188 --> 01:29:54,490
- NOW DOWN TO YOU.
- RIDICULOUS.

1868
01:29:54,523 --> 01:29:56,625
I'M JUST TRYING TO FIGURE OUT
THE MOVIE.

1869
01:29:56,658 --> 01:29:58,527
HEY, NELSON LOSE-DELA,

1870
01:29:58,560 --> 01:30:02,098
WE ALMOST GOT
THESE BASS-ACKWARDS
CHICKEN-FRIED IDIOTS

1871
01:30:02,132 --> 01:30:04,300
INTO THINKING
THIS IS A CRUISE SHIP.

1872
01:30:04,333 --> 01:30:06,835
NOW WE JUST HAVE TO GET
THROUGH THE CAPTAIN'S DINNER.

1873
01:30:06,868 --> 01:30:09,338
WHAT COULD POSSIBLY GO WRONG?

1874
01:30:09,372 --> 01:30:11,740
[CLEARS THROAT]

1875
01:30:11,773 --> 01:30:14,210
AS CAPTAIN OF THIS CASTLE--

1876
01:30:14,243 --> 01:30:17,480
OW. AND BY CASTLE,
I MEAN SHIP,

1877
01:30:17,513 --> 01:30:19,715
I'D LIKE TO WELCOME YOU
TO MY TABLE.

1878
01:30:19,748 --> 01:30:22,452
WAITER, IF YOU'D SERVE THE CRAP,
PLEASE.

1879
01:30:22,485 --> 01:30:26,155
YOUR SCALLOPS IN HERBED BUTTER,
CRUSHED AND TOASTED,

1880
01:30:26,188 --> 01:30:30,225
AND SERVED WITH TINY BLUE
MARSHMALLOWS, MADAM.

1881
01:30:30,258 --> 01:30:34,463
UH, CAPTAIN, WHEN WILL WE
BE ALLOWED UP ON DECK?

1882
01:30:34,497 --> 01:30:36,798
- CAPTAIN?
- CAPTAIN?

1883
01:30:36,832 --> 01:30:40,837
- OW, QUIT HITTING ME.
- WELL, ANSWER THE NICE...

1884
01:30:40,870 --> 01:30:42,905
[GROWLING]

1885
01:30:42,938 --> 01:30:44,173
THE TRANQUILIZER GUN!

1886
01:30:44,207 --> 01:30:45,475
[GUN POPS]

1887
01:30:48,343 --> 01:30:49,745
WILL THERE BE ANYTHING ELSE?

1888
01:30:49,812 --> 01:30:54,183
- UH, NO, WE'RE GOOD.
- GOOD.

1889
01:30:54,217 --> 01:30:55,383
[GUN POPS]

1890
01:32:02,418 --> 01:32:04,120
[GASPS]

1891
01:32:04,153 --> 01:32:06,388
- BOB, IT'S RIGHT UNDERNEATH US.
- I KNOW!
